  <para style="h">Zumbunulo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Zumbunuligwa kwaJohane</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zumbunulo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Zumb</para>
  <para style="mt1">ZUMBUNULIGWA KWAJOHANE</para>
  <para style="mt3">kuna Johane</para>
  <para style="imt">Tjinginiso</para>
  <para style="ip">Lukwalo gunoyi Zumbunulo ndigo lukwalo gwebupelo muThesitamenti Tshwa. Gwakakwagwa mumakole angaba makumi ali hhanhalume anamakole mahanu hule kwezwagwa kwaKhirisitu, gwakakwagwa neMpositoli Johane (Zumbunulo1.1). Kakale waka kwala Ndebo Mbuya sekwagwa kwayo naJohane, newhalo nhatu dzinoyi 1 Johane, 2 Johane na 3 Johane. Johane waka ezibgwa sa iwhoya “waka ediwa naYesu” (Johane 13.23). Johane wakakwala lukwalo gweZumbunulo ali mutjigwizi tjePhathimosi kwaaka ayendisiwako alimubusungwa ngentha yesumikila Ndebo Mbuya yaYesu Khirisitu (Johane 1.9).</para>
  <para style="ip">Tjinangwa tjaJohane pakukwala lukwalo gweZumbunulo kwaka kulikuludzila babali kuti bayendele mbeli bakagalamoyo kuna Yesu Khirisitu, kakale waka ehaka bagadzabgwe ngobe lubaka gwehanduka kwaYesu gwatjibapedlo (Zumbunulo 1.3, 22.7). Wakakwalila maKhirisitu ose zwawo, nemakubungano ebagalimoyo alikutondeka (Zumbunulo 2.1-3.23.) Johane unotala whalo dzidze sebulebesambeli (1.3) kakale unohingisa zwifaniso zwinjinji mulukwalo gugwe gose kutti athaluse zwinhu zwaaka ebona. Lukwalo igogu gofanana nezwimwe zwikamu zwinowanika Mutjibvumilano tjaNtolo tjeNdebo Mbuya hapa tilingisisa bukulu Zakhariya 6.1-8. Nyanga dzinolidziwa dzilikutondeka nendigwana dzilikutondeka dzakafanana nengwele dzakatumiwa neNdzimu kuti alange nadzo baEgipite (Ekisodusi 7-9). Lukwalo gweZumbunulo golebeleka nekwelubaka gobupelo, guleba kuti Yesu ndiye unowhokunda, bose banogalabgwe kuwunli banowhotjila naye nekusingapele. Lukwalo igogu ngagukutjemele kakale gukupe lingililo inoti Yesu unobuya nekutjimbidza.</para>
  <para style="iot">Nlongoloso Yezwimukati</para>
  <para style="io1">Johane unotanga nezwizibisa kuti iye ndiye ani, elondesedza kuti wakawamutjila tjini tjibono itjetji tjebulebesambeli (1.1-1.20).</para>
  <para style="io1">Unoyendesa ndebo kumakubangano ebayengemali alikutondeka inobva dumbu kunaYesu (1.1-3.22).</para>
  <para style="io1">Unoyendela mbeli ethalusa pehhugwi kwezwizwino zwilikutondeka (4.1-8.5) kakale nenyanga dzinolidziwa dzili kutondeka (8.6-11.19).</para>
  <para style="io1">Hule kwayikoko Johane unothalusa pehhugwi kwengwa ipakati kwenkololo nehangale inamiholo ilikutondeka (12.1-14.20).</para>
  <para style="io1">Unokwala pehhugwi kwendigwana dzebuhongola dzilikutondeka (15.1-16.18).</para>
  <para style="io1">Kunotebela Johane unolondesedza kunda kweNdzimu pehhugwi kwezwita zwizwe mungwa dzinotikala kudzimu (17.1-20.15).</para>
  <para style="io1">Unopedzisila nelondesedza pehhugwi kwekudzimu kutshwa nehango tshwa iko kunowhohha mulubaka gwebupelo (21.1-22.21).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1" />Zumbunulo yaYesu Khirisitu, yaakapiwa neNdzimu, kuti alakidze balanda babe zwinhu zwinowhohha nekutjimbidza; wakatuma ntumwa uwe kuti azwizibise nlanda uwe Johane. <verse eid="REV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2" />Iye Johane wakapa busupi ngekwedama leNdzimu nangebusupi ngekwaYesu Khirisitu nekumwe kose kwaakabona. <verse eid="REV 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3" />Wakakombolegwa iwhoyo unobalila pehhugwi matama ebulebesambeli igogu, kakale bakakombolegwa nayibabo banowha kakale betjengeta ikoko kwakakwagwa mukati, ngobe lubaka gwatjibapedlo.<verse eid="REV 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Buyisiwa Kwemakubungano Ebagalimoyo Alikutondeka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 1:4" />Kubva kuna Johane ekwalila makubungano ebagalimoyo ali kutondeka amuhango yeAsiya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:4">Ngoni nekunyalala kunobva kuna iye uyapo, waka elipo, iye unohha, nekunobva bo nekumeya dzili kutondeka dzimbeli kwetjigalo tjitje tjebumambo; ngakube kumuli, <verse eid="REV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 1:5" />nekunobva kuna Yesu Khirisitu, nsupi unogalikabgwe, iye mbano yebafi, ntongi wabomambo behango.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:5">Kuna iye unotida wakatisunungula mumatjinyo edu nemalopa awe <verse eid="REV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6" />akatithama kuti tibe bumambo nekuti tibe baphirisiti beNdzimu banoba Tate babe, ngaakudziwe kakale abenemasimba nekusingapele. Akujalo.<verse eid="REV 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7" />Lingani, unohha ali mumakole, hhiho limwe nelimwe lowhumbona nayibabo bakawumbhaya, njudzi dzose dzehango dzowhokuwa nentha iye. Lebeswa. Akujalo.<verse eid="REV 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8" />“Ndimi Alifa naOmega,” kujalo He Ndzimu, iye uyapo, waka elipo, iye unowhohha, iye Masimba ose.<verse eid="REV 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbono waKhirisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9" />Imi Johane hama yenyu, ndihanganyila namwi muna Yesu mukudziyidziwa, nemubumambo, nemoyonlefu mukusimidzila, ndakabe ndili tjimugwizi tjinoyi Phathimosi nentha yedama leNdzimu kakale nentha yebusupi gwaYesu. <verse eid="REV 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10" />Imi ndakabe ndili muMeya muhhuba laHe, ndikawha hule kwangu whi gulugulu linga lelunyanga gunolidziwa, <verse eid="REV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11" />liti, “Kwala tjawunobona mulukwalo, ukutumile kumakubungano ebagalimoyo alikutondeka, kuEfesu, nekuSimayina, nekuPegamamu nekuThiyathira nekuSadisi nekuFiladefiya nekuLayodisiya.”<verse eid="REV 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12" />Ndakatjebuka kuti ndibone whi laka lilebeleka nemi, ndikati ndatjebuka ndikabona zwigadziko zwezwivoneko zwezeezi zwilikutondeka. <verse eid="REV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13" />Pakati kwezwigadziko izwezwi kwakabe kuna unonga nkololo wenhu, waka akambala jila lefulefu, akapombela pafuba tjitje mwandabula wezeezi; <verse eid="REV 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14" />n'holo uwe nemavudzi awe kwaka kuli kutjenatjena sebukuse gutjena, kuli kutjenatjena semakahaa, meho awe aka enga bibi lemoto. <verse eid="REV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15" />Makumbo awe aka enga tshipi yaka bulungiwa nembehho kunga kunoyi yakapisiwa muvutho, whi lile liwhakala sevula njinji inowona iwunga ijitila pahongwe. <verse eid="REV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16" />Muluboko gugwe gweludli waka akabhata nyenyedzi dzilikutondeka, munlomo uwe kwakabhuda bhangatjeke linopiza ntha dzose, buso gugwe gupenya sehhuba linopenya nemasimba alo ose. <verse eid="REV 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17" />Ndakati ndiwumbona awila pasi kwemakumbo awe sekunoyi ndafa. Koga wakabiga luboko gugwe goludli pehhugwi kwangu ekalebeleka nami eti, “Usihle, ndimi wekutanga newebupelo, <verse eid="REV 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18" />ndimi unotjila; ndakafa, koga ndeetjila nekusingapele, ndina makhiyi elufu neHhedesi. <verse eid="REV 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19" />Ngwenu kwala zwinhu zwawunobona, nezwinhu zwiyapo, nezwinhu zwinowhohha hule kwayizwezwi. <verse eid="REV 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20" />Tjakasumbikika tjenyenyedzi dzili kutondeka dzawakabona muluboko gwangu gweludli nezwigadziko zwezwivoneko zwezeezi ndiwhoku; nyenyedzi dzilikutondeka batumwa bemakubungano ebagalimoyo alikutondeka, zwigadziko zwezwivoneko zwilikutondeka makubungano ebagalimoyo alikutondeka.<verse eid="REV 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2" />
  <para style="s">Dama KuGubungano Lebayengemali Baku Efesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1" />“Kwalila ntumwa wekugubungano lebagalimoyo bakuEfesu uti. ‘Ihawa ndiwomatama awe wakabhata muluboko gugwe goludli nyenyedzi dzili kutondeka, iye unoyenda yenda pakati kwezwigadziko zwezwivoneko zwezeezi. <verse eid="REV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2" />Ndoziba mihingo iyo, hinga zwakabangalala kuko, simidzila kuko nemoyo nlefu uwo, nekuti awutowamutjila banhu babi koga wakaholesesa ibo banozwidana bezwiti bapositoli ibo besi ibo, ukababhata kuti banoleba manyepwa; <verse eid="REV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3" />Ndoziba kuti nosimidzila nemoyo nlefu mubulemo nentha yezina langu, awuzotongonyala. <verse eid="REV 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4" />Koga ndina kumwe kwandinon'un'urika pehhugwi kuko, kuti wakalaha ludo gwawaka unago kutanga. <verse eid="REV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5" />Uyalakane pawakathewuka, uhanduke kakale uthame mihingo yawaka uthama kwekutanga. Hapa kusakajalo, ndowhokukumba ndihha ndidusa tjigadziko tjetjivoneko tjitjo pabugalo gwatjo, hapa usahanduka. <verse eid="REV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6" />Koga tjawunatjo ndiyetji, kuti nobenga zwiyeto zwemaNikhola, zwinoba zwiyeto zwandinobenga bo.’ ”<verse eid="REV 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7" />“Iye unazebe, ngaawhe tjinolebgwa neMeya kumakubungano ebagalimoyo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:7">“Kuna iwhoya unowhokunda ndowhowumpa masimba ekuti adle ntjelo wenti webutjilo, umukati kwePharadayisi leNdzimu.”<verse eid="REV 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dama KuGubungano Lebayengemali bakuSamuyana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8" />“Kwalila kuntumwa wekugubungano lebayengemali likuSimayina uti,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:8">‘Ihawa ndiwo matama awe iye wekutanga newebupelo, wakafa koga akabuya akatjila. <verse eid="REV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9" />Ndoziba dziyila nebuhayi gugo, koga iwe wakafuma, kakale ndoziba masapa anolebgwa nayibabo banozwiti ibo maJuta ibo basi iwo, koga bali sinagogu yaSatane. <verse eid="REV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10" />Usihle iko dziyila kwabapedlo nekukuwila, muzibe kuti Satane wabapedlo neposela bamwe benyu mujele kuti mulikiwe, mowhomanikana kwemahhuba aligumi. Ube wakagalikabgwe kuswikila palufu, ndowhokupa tjiyala tjebutjilo.’ ”<verse eid="REV 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11" />“Iye unazebe ngaawhe kunolebgwa neMeya kumakubungano ebagalimoyo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:11">“Iye unokunda atowhowhisiwa zogwadza nelufu gwebubili.”<verse eid="REV 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matama KuGubungano Lebayengemali bakuPhegamamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12" />“Kwalila ntumwa wekugubungano lebayengemali bakuPhegamamu uti, ‘Ihawa matama awe unabhangatjeke linopiza ntha dzose. <verse eid="REV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13" />Ndoziba, pawunogala, ipapo panatjigalo tjaSatane; wakabhatilila pazina langu, kakale awuzotongolandula galamoyo kuko mundili, kene mumahhuba aAntipasi nsupi wangu unogalikabgwe iye wakabulawa pakati kwenyu ipapo panogala Satane. <verse eid="REV 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14" />Koga ndina zwinhu zwihomanana zwandino n'un'urika nekwazo pehhugwi kuko, ngobe muna bamwe pakati kwenyu batjakabhatilila pazwidiyo zwaBhalamu, iye wakadiya Balaki kuti ateye bana beIsirayeli, kuti badle zodliwa zwakapigwa midzimwana, kakale bayete bupombgwe. <verse eid="REV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15" />Kakale unabamwe bakabhatilila pazwidiyo zwebaNikhola. <verse eid="REV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16" />Ndizoke handuka. Hapa kusakajalo, ndowhohha kukuli nekulibilidza, kakale ndowhogwa nabo nebhangatjeke lenlomo wangu.’ ”<verse eid="REV 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17" />“Iye unazebe ngaawhe kunolebgwa neMeya kumakubungano ebagalimoyo!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:17">“Iwhoyo unokunda ndowhowumpa imwe yemana yakasumbikika, kakale ndowumpa bgwe jena, lakakwagwa zina dzwa lisina unoliziba kuhhe kwa iwhoyo unoliwamutjila.”<verse eid="REV 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matama KuGubungano Lebagalimoyo BakuTiyatira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18" />“Kwalila ntumwa wegubungano lebayengemali bakuTiyatira uti, ‘Ihawa matama eNkololo weNdzimu, unameho anonga bibi lemoto; Unamakumbo anonga tshipi yakabulungiwa. <verse eid="REV 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19" />Ndoziba mihingo iyo, neludo gugo, nebugalimoyo gugo, nehingila kuko Ndzimu, nemoyo nlefu uwo wesimidzila, kakale kuti mihingo iyo yangwenu inopinda yekutanga. <verse eid="REV 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20" />Koga ndina whoku kwandinon'un'urika pehhugwi kuko, kuti unowamutjila nkadzimayi iwhoya unoyi Jezebheli, unozwidana eti unlebesambeli wetjikadzi. Unodiya ethewula balanda bangu eyeta kuti bathame bupombgwe, kakale kuti badle zodliwa zwakapigwa kumidzimwana. <verse eid="REV 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21" />Ndakawumpa lubaka gokuti ahanduke, asiye bupombgwe gugwe koga unolamba handuka kubva mubupombgwe gugwe. <verse eid="REV 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22" />Ndizoke ndowumposela panhobo yebugwele, kakale nayibabo banothama bupombgwe naye ndowhobasa mukudziyidzika kukulu hapa besingahanduke muzwiyeto zwizwe, <verse eid="REV 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23" />ndowhobulaya bana babe. Ipapo makubungano ebagalimoyo ose anowhoziba kuti ndimi ndinofunyungudza nkumbulo nemoyo, ndowhopa umwe newumwe kunoyendilana nemihingo iye.’ ”<verse eid="REV 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24" />“Koga kumuli mose bakuTiyatira, basakabhatilila pazwidiyo zwizwe, basakazwidiya ikoku kunodan'wa nebamwe kuyi ‘zwinhu zwakasumbikika zwikukutu zwaSatane,’ kumuli ndoti, akuna gumwe bulemo gwandinotilika pehhugwi kwenyu. <verse eid="REV 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25" />Bhatisisani kwamunako ndidzina ndihha. <verse eid="REV 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26" />Iye unokunda kakale ehinga mihingo yangu kudza kunoti kubupelo, ndowhowumpa masimba pehhugwi kwenjudzi, <verse eid="REV 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27" />unowhotonga pehhugwi kwadzo neswimbo yetshipi; unowhobapwanya sehali dzentapwi, sekwandakawamutjila masimba kubva kunaTate bangu, <verse eid="REV 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28" />ndowumpa nyenyedzi inoyi masasi.”<verse eid="REV 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29" />“Iye unazebe ngaawhe kunolebgwa neMeya kumakubungano ebagalimoyo.”<verse eid="REV 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3" />
  <para style="s">Matama KubaSadisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1" />“Kwalila ntumwa wekugubungano lebagalimoyo bakuSadisi uti, ‘Ihawa ndiwo matama anolebgwa nayiye unaMeya dzeNdzimu dzilikutondeka nenyenyedzi dzilikutondeka. Ndoziba mihingo iyo, unazina linolakidza kuti umpenyu, koga wakafa. <verse eid="REV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2" />Muka usimise zwasala, zwabapedlo nefa, ngobe andizowana mihingo iyo yakapelela mbeli kweNdzimu wangu. <verse eid="REV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3" />Uyalakane tjawakawamutjila netjawakawha, utjengete zwinhu izwezo, kakale uhanduke. Koga hapa usingamuke ndowhohha sembava, awutowhoziba lubaka gwandinowhoswika nago kukuli. <verse eid="REV 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4" />Koga utjina banhu mahomanana muSadisi, basakalonga hambgwa zwiyambalo zwabo, banowhoyenda nemi bakambala zwiyambalo zwitjena, ngobe bakafanila ikoko. <verse eid="REV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5" />Iwhoyo unokunda, unowhombadziwa zwiyambalo zwitjena sayibo, kakale andingadzime zina lile mulukwalo gwebutjilo, koga ndowhopa busupi nekwezina lile mbeli kwaTate bangu, nangembeli kwebatumwa babo.’ ”<verse eid="REV 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6" />“Iye unazebe ngaawhe tjinolebgwa neMeya kumakubungano ebagalimoyo.”<verse eid="REV 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matama KubaFiladefiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7" />“Kwalila ntumwa wekugubungano lebagalimoyo likuFiladefiya uti, ‘Ihawa ndiwo matama anobva kuna iye wakayengemala, iye wemalebeswa, iye unakhiyi yaDavida, unoti hapa ahhula akuna ungahhalila, unoti hapa ahhalila akuna ungahhula. <verse eid="REV 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8" />Ndoziba mihingo iyo. Linga, ndasa nkoba wakahhulika mbeli kuko, akuna ungawuhhalila, ndoziba kuti unamasimba mahomanana koga wakatjengeta dama langu, awuzolandula zina langu. <verse eid="REV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9" />Ibabo besinagogu yaSatane banozwiti maJuta ibo besi maJuta koga benyepa, ndowhothama kuti bahhe bewhokotama pamakumbo awo kakale bazibe kuti iwe ndakakuda. <verse eid="REV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10" />Saku wakatjengeta nlayo wangu wekuti usimidzile nemoyonlefu, nami ndowhokutjengeta mulubaka gwelikiwa gunowhoba pehhugwi kwehango yose, gohha guwholika ibabo banogala muhango. <verse eid="REV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11" />Ndohha nekulibilidza. Bhatisisa tjawunatjo, kuyetila kuti kusitongoba nenhu unokutolela tjiyala tjitjo. <verse eid="REV 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12" />Iye unokunda ndowunthama akabe mhanda muThempeli leNdzimu wangu, haatowhobhuda mulili, kakale ndowhokwala pawunli zina leNdzimu wangu, nezina lenzi-nkulu weNdzimu wangu, linoba Jerusalema tshwa linojita pasi libva kuNdzimu wangu libhuda kudzimu, kakale ndowhokwala pawunli zina langu tshwa.’ ”<verse eid="REV 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13" />“Iye unazebe ngaawhe tjinolebgwa neMeya kumakubungano ebagalimoyo.”<verse eid="REV 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matama kubaLayodikhiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14" />“Kwalila ntumwa wekugubungano lebayengemali lekuLayodikhiya uti, ‘Iwa matama aAkujalo, iye nsupi unogalikabgwe kakale ali wemalebeswa, tshinde lazose zwakabumbiwa neNdzimu. <verse eid="REV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15" />Ndoziba mihingo iyo, kuti awutotonhola kakale awutopisa, ndoyemula kuti kadzene utonhola kene upisa! <verse eid="REV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16" />Ngono nentha yekuti unodziya koga, usingatonhole kene pisa ndowhokupfa ndikakudusa munlomo wangu. <verse eid="REV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17" />Ngobe unoti, ‘Ndakafuma,’ ‘Ndakabhudilila,’ ‘Handina tjandinohaya,’ usingazibe kuti ulombe, nowhisa zogwadza, un'hayi, ubhofu kakale umbudlo. <verse eid="REV 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18" />Ndokulaya mano, ndoti, tenga zeezi kundili lakatjenesewa ngekupisiwa ngemoto kuyetila kuti ube mfumi, utenge zwiyambalo zwitjena kuti umbale, kuyetila kuti uzwine bumbudlo gugo gunobhatisa honi, utenge mafuta uhhodze meho awo kuyetila kuti ubone. <verse eid="REV 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19" />Bunji gwebandinoda ndobatjemela, kakale ndobalanga, ndizoke halabvuka uhanduke. <verse eid="REV 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20" />Linga! Ndimile pankoba, ndipindisa, hapa nhu ewha whi langu, akahhula nkoba, imi ndowhongina kuwunli, ndikadla naye, iyebo akadla nemi. <verse eid="REV 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21" />Iwhoyo unokunda, ndowhothama kuti agale nami mutjigalo tjangu tjobumambo, sami sekwandakakunda, ndigele naTate bangu patjigalo tjabo tjobumambo.”<verse eid="REV 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22" />“Iye unazebe ngaawhe tjinolebgwa neMeya kumakubungano ebagalimoyo.”<verse eid="REV 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4" />
  <para style="s">Lumbidza KwekuDzimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1" />Hule kwayikoko ndakalinga ndikabona nkoba wakahhulika kudzimu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:1">Whi landakawha lilebeleka nami kutanga sensindo welunyanga lakati kundili, “Hha ngeno pehhugwi, ndikulakidze zwinhu zwinowhoyetika hule kwayikoku.” <verse eid="REV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2" />Tjinyolotjo ndakaba muMeya, ndikabona tjigalo tjobumambo kudzimu, kuna umwe ugele pehhugwi kwatjo. <verse eid="REV 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3" />Iwhoya waka eligele pehhugwi kwatjo waka elingika sebgwe lejasipha nelekhaneliya, tjigalo tjobumambo tjaka tjakakombeledzewa nenlanlabungo waka ulingika sebgwe le emaralidi. <verse eid="REV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4" />Kwaka kuna zwimwe zwigalo zwebumambo zwili makumi mabili nezwina zwakakombeledza tjigalo tjobumambo, pehhugwi kwezwigalo izwezo kwakakuligele bawhola bali makumi mabili nebana, bawhola bakabakambala zwiyambalo zwitjena, mumiholo yabo kuna zwiyala zwezeezi. <verse eid="REV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5" />Kubva patjigalo tjobumambo kwakakubhuda penya kwenthari nebomba netitima, mbeli kwetjigalo tjobumambo kopfuta zwivoneko zwilikutondeka, ndidzo meya dzilikutondeka dzeNdzimu. <verse eid="REV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6" />Mbeli kwetjigalo tjobumambo kwaka kuna tjinonga gungwa legilazi linobelengela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:6">Kwakakuna zwipuka zwinotjila zwilizwina pakati, dzakakombeledza tjigalo tjobumambo dzilihhele meho mbeli nahule. <verse eid="REV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7" />Tjipuka tjinotjila tjekutanga tjaka tjinga humba, tjipuka tjinotjila tjebubili tjinga nkono wen'ombe, tjipuka tjinotjila tjebutatu tjaka tjina buso gunonga gwenhu, tjipuka tjinotjila tjebuna tjinga lumhangu gupururuka. <verse eid="REV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8" />Tjimwe netjimwe tjezwipuka zwina zwinotjila tjaka tjinamapapiro matanhatu kakale tjimwe netjimwe tjilihhele meho ntha dzose, siku nesikati dzimba dzisinganyalale dziti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:8">“Wakayengemala, wakayengemala, wakayengemala, iye He Ndzimu Wemasimba ose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:8">waka elipo, uyapo, iye unohha.”<verse eid="REV 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9" />Hapa zwipuka zwinotjila zwikudza zwilemekedza kakale zwiboka, iwhoya ugele patjigalo tjobumambo, iye unotjila nekusingapele, <verse eid="REV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10" />whola dzili makumi mabili nebana dzokotama mbeli kwa iwhoya ugele pehhugwi kwetjigalo tjobumambo, dziwunamata iye unotjila nekusingapele, dzombula dzibiga pasi mbeli kwetjigalo tjobumambo zwiyala zwadzo dziti,<verse eid="REV 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11" />“Makafanila He wedu neNdzimu wedu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">kuti muwamutjile gudzo, nelemekedzewa, nemasimba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">ngentha yekuti makabumba zwinhu zose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">ngekuda zwakabumbiwa kakale zwiyapo.”<verse eid="REV 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5" />
  <para style="s">Lukwalo Gunopeteka NeMwizana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1" />Ndakabona muluboko goludli gwawhoya ugele patjigalo tjebumambo, lukwalo gwakakwaga mukati nekuhhe gwakahhaligwa nezwizwino zwilikutondeka, <verse eid="REV 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2" />kakale ndakabona ntumwa wekuNdzimu unamasimba edanilila newhi gulugulu eti, “Ndiyani wakafanila hhula lukwalo nekwamula zwizwino zwago?” <verse eid="REV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3" />Akuna nhu kudzimu, kene muhango, kene pasi kwehango wakatubula hhula lukwalo, kene iko linga mukati kwago. <verse eid="REV 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4" />Ndakalila kwazo, ngobe kwakahayika nhu wakafanila hhula lukwalo, kene iko linga mukati kwago. <verse eid="REV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5" />Ndizo umwe webawhola wakati kundili, “Usilile, Humba yeludzi gwaJuda, eli Ndzi waDavida, wakunda, kuyetila kuti atubule hhula lukwalo nekwamula zwizwino zwago zwilikutondeka.”<verse eid="REV 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6" />Kakale ndakabona Mwizana kunga kunhoyi yakabulawa, ilimile pakati kwetjigalo tjobumambo, yakakombeledzewa nezwipuka zwinotjila zwina nebawhola. Mwizana yaka inanyanga dzilikutondeka, nemeho alikutondeka, kunoba Meya dzilikutondeka dzeNdzimu dzakatumwa muhango yose. <verse eid="REV 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7" />Wakayenda akanotola lukwalo muluboko gweludli gwa iye waka eligele patjigalo tjebumambo. <verse eid="REV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8" />Wakati atola lukwalo, zwipuka zwinotjila zwina, nebawhola bali makumi mabili nebana bakakotama mbeli kweMwizana, umwe newumwe wabo waka anadende nendigwana dzezeezi dzihhele mhoza, kuli mitembezelo yebakayengemala. <verse eid="REV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9" />Bakamba lumbo gutshwa beti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">“Ndimwi makafanila tola lukwalo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">nehhula zwizwino,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">ngobe makabulawa kakale nemalopa enyu makakatengela Ndzimu banhu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">Banhu benjudzi dzose, nebendimi dzose, nebehango dzose,<verse eid="REV 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10" />makabathama kuti babe bumambo nebuphirisiti kuNdzimu wedu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:10">banowhotonga pehhugwi kwehango.”<verse eid="REV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11" />Ipapo ndakalinga kakale ndikawha whi lebatumwa bekudzimu banjinji, ibo baka bali zwiwulu zwezwiwulu, gumi lezwiwulu lakapamhiwa kagumi lezwiwulu. Baka bakakombeledza tjigalo tjebumambo, nezwipuka zwinotjila nebawhola. <verse eid="REV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12" />Baka beti newhi gulugulu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">“Mwizana yakabulawa yakafanila</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">kuti iwamutjile masimba, nefumwa, nebutjenjebvu, nesimba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">nelemekedzewa, nekudziwa, nelumbidziwa!”<verse eid="REV 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13" />Ndakawha tjimwe netjimwe tjipuka tjiikudzimu, netjiimuhango, netjipasi kwehango, netjimukati kwegungwa nezwinotjila imhomo zwiti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">“Kuwunli ugele patjigalo tjobumambo nekuMwizana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:13">Ngaalumbidziwe, alemekedziwe, akudziwe, iye nesimba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:13">nekusingapele.”<verse eid="REV 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14" />Zwipuka zwinotjila zwina zwakahandula zwiti, “Akujalo!” Bawhola bakakotama bakanamata.<verse eid="REV 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6" />
  <para style="s">Zwizwino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1" />Ndizoke ndakabona Mwizana payaka hhula tjimwe tjezwizwino zwilikutondeka, ndakakowha tjimwe tjezwipuka zwina zwinotjila tjiti, “Ihha!” newhi linonga titima kwevula. <verse eid="REV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2" />Ndakalinga abona mbizi njena, waka akayitanha waka akabhata wuta, wakakowamutjidziwa tjiyala, wakabhuda ekunda, eyenda enokunda.<verse eid="REV 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3" />Wakati ahhula tjizwino tjebubili, ndikawha tjipuka tjinotjila tjebubili tjiti “ihha!” <verse eid="REV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4" />Kukabhuda imwe mbizi ilihabahaba kwazo, whoya waka akayitanha wakapiwa masimba kuti aduse kunyalala muhango yose, neyeta kuti banhu babulayane, wakapiwa bhangatjeke gulugulu.<verse eid="REV 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5" />Mwizana payakahhula tjizwino tjebutatu ndakawha tjipuka tjebutatu tjinotjila tjiti, “Ihha!” Ndikabona mbizi nhema mbeli kwangu, waka akayitanha waka akabhata tjiyelo muluboko gugwe. <verse eid="REV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6" />Ndakawha kunga whi lipakati kwezwipuka zwina zwinotjila liti, “tjiyelo tjezwidlo tjowhotengwa nedinari<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dinari waka ulinlipo wen'hingo wehhuba lose</char></note>, zwiyelo zwitatu zwebhali zowhotengwa nedinari, mafuta newayini musikupaladze!”<verse eid="REV 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7" />Mwizana yakati ihhula tjizwino tjobuna, awha whi letjipuka tjinotjila tjobuna liti “Ihha!” <verse eid="REV 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8" />Ndakabona mbizi yembala wakapanguka, na iwhoya waka akayitanha, zina lile waka eyi Lufu, Hhadesi yaka iwuntobela ilipedlo, zwikapiwa masimba pehhugwi kwelubabi gun'ompela gwembabi dzilina dzehango yose, kuti zwibulaye nebhangatjeke, nehhala, kakale nebugwele, nezwibanda zwemuhango.<verse eid="REV 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9" />Mwizana yakati yahhula tjizwino tjebuhanu ndakabona pasi kwetjibeso, meya dzayibabo bakabulayigwa dama leNdzimu nebusupi gwabaka bakabhatisisa. <verse eid="REV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10" />Baka bedanilila newhi gulugulu beti, “Imwi He munamasimba, imwi, makayengemala, imwi wemalebeswa, kowhodzina kukaba lini musingatonge kakale musingabgwilizile bakatebula lopa ledu bagele muhango?” <verse eid="REV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11" />Umwe newumwe wabo wakapiwa jila lefulefu jena bakabudziwa kuti banyaluluke kwelubakanyana, kuswikila bamwe babaka beli balanda nabo, nehama dzabo muna He, baka bewhobulawa sekwabakabulwa babulawa bose.<verse eid="REV 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12" />Ndakalinga ndikabona Mwizana ihhula tjizwino tjebutanhatu kukaba netengenyeka kwehango kukulukulu, hhuba likaba demadema sejila lesaka laka yetiwa nebukuse gwembudzi, mwedzi wose ukahanduka ukaba n'haba semalopa. <verse eid="REV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13" />Nyenyedzi dzipehhugwi dzikawila pasi muhango, senkuyu uhahamula bana bawo bebupelo basakayibva hapa uzunguziwa nemhepo njinji, <verse eid="REV 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14" />kuhhuhhugwi kwakamila senhu epeta lukwalo, limwe nelimwe dombo netjimwe tjigwizi kwakadusiwa pabugalo gwako. <verse eid="REV 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15" />Bomambo behango, nabohe, nebatungamili bebagwi, bakafuma nebanamasimba, nebanhu bose, balanda nebakasununguka, bakabgwata mumakuwhu napakati kwehongwe dzematombo, <verse eid="REV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16" />bakadanilila matombo nehongwe beti, “Mutiwile mutisumbike kubuso gwa iye ugele patjigalo tjobumambo, nekubuhongola gweMwizana, <verse eid="REV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17" />ngobe hhuba gulu lebuhongola gwabo laswika, ndiyani unowhotubula ma mbeli kwalo?”<verse eid="REV 6:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7" />
  <para style="s">Gulu leTjiwulu Lina Zwiwulu Zwili Makumi Mana NeMana Zwebanhu BeIsirayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1" />Hule kwayikoko ndakabona batumwa bekudzimu bana balimile kuntha dzilina dzehango, bakabhata mhepo dzilina dzehango kuyeta kuti kusibe nemhepo inohhuhhudza pehhugwi kwehango, kene pehhugwi kwegungwa, kene inozunguza wupi nti zwawo. <verse eid="REV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2" />Ndakabona umwe ntumwa wekudzimu eyenda pehhugwi ebva kunobhuda hhuba akabhata tjizwino tjeNdzimu unotjila, wakadanilila newhi gulugulu kubatumwa bekudzimu bana bakabapiwa masimba ekubadza hango negungwa, <verse eid="REV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3" />waka eti, “Musikubadze hango kene gungwa kene miti, kuswikila balanda beNdzimu wedu balongwa lutjayo pamhahha dzabo.” <verse eid="REV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4" />Ndakawha bunji gwabo, gwayibabo baka bakalongwa lutjayo, bakabali gulu lezwiwulu lina zwiwulu zwili makumi mana nemana, ezwiwulu, bebva munjudzi dzose dzebakololo baIsirayeli. <verse eid="REV 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5" />Beludzi gwaJuda bakalongwa lutjayo baka baligumi nembili lezwiwulu, baka bebva muludzi gwaRubheni baligumi nembili lezwiwulu, gumi nembili lezwiwulu bebva kuludzi gwaGadi, <verse eid="REV 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6" />beludzi gwaAseri bali gumi nembili lezwiwulu, beludzi gwaNafithali bali gumi nembili lezwiwulu, beludzi gwaManase bali gumi nembili lezwiwulu, <verse eid="REV 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7" />beludzi gwaSimiyoni baligumi nembili lezwiwulu, beludzi gwaLevi bali gumi nembili lezwiwulu, beludzi gwaIsakha bali gumi nembili lezwiwulu, <verse eid="REV 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8" />beludzi gwaZebhuloni baligumi nembili lezwiwulu, beludzi gwaJosefa baligumi nembili lezwiwulu, beludzi gwaBhenjamini baligumi nembili.<verse eid="REV 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bunga Gulusa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9" />Hule kwayikoko ndikabona mbunga webanhu nkulu usingake ukatubugwa bagwa nenhu, bebva mutjimwe netjimwe tjaba, nemuludzi gose, nemubanhu bose, bebva nemundimi dzose, balimile mbeli kwetjigalo tjobumambo nambeli kweMwizana. Bakabakambala majila matjena, bakabhata nhabi dzemilala, <verse eid="REV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10" />bakamimila newhi gulugulu beti, “Tjidziwa ndekweNdzimu wedu, ugele patjigalo tjobumambo, kakale ndekweMwizana bo!” <verse eid="REV 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11" />Batumwa bekudzimu bose bakabelimile baka kombeledza tjigalo tjobumambo kakale bakakombeledza bawhola nezwipuka zwina zwinotjila, bakakotama mbeli kwetjigalo tjobumambo, bakanamata Ndzimu, <verse eid="REV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12" />beti, “Akujalo! Kombolegwa negudzo nebutjenjebvu, nebokewa, nelemekedzewa, masimba, nemasimba ose ngakube kuNdzimu wedu, nekusingapele! Akujalo.”<verse eid="REV 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13" />Umwe webawhola, wakalebeleka nemi eti, “Ndiboyani ibaba bakambala zwiyambalo zwitjena kakale banobva poni?”<verse eid="REV 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14" />Ndakahandula nditi kuwunli, “He, imwi moziba.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 7:14">Wakati kundili, “Ibaba ndibo banobhuda mukudziyila kukulukulu, bakasuka zwiyambalo zwabo bakazwithama zwikaba zwitjenatjena mumalopa eMwizana. <verse eid="REV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15" />Ndizo ndiko belimbeli kwetjigalo tjebumambo tjeNdzimu, bewuhingila siku nesikati muthempeli lile, iwhoya ugele patjigalo tjobumambo unowhobatjengeta nebuyapo gugwe. <verse eid="REV 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16" />Habatowhopamha bakawha hhala kakale habatowhopamha bakawha nyota, kene tshwa nehhuba, kene pisiwa nekumwe kuno pisa kwazo. <verse eid="REV 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17" />Ngobe Mwizana ipakati kwetjigalo tjobumambo, inowhoba nlisi wabo, unowhoba tungamilila kumisenya yevula dzebupenyu, kakale Ndzimu unowhobuhika mihodzi yabo yose kumeho abo.”<verse eid="REV 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8" />
  <para style="s">Tjizwino Tjebutondeki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1" />Mwizana yakakati yahhula tjizwino tjebutondeki, kwakaba nekunyalala kudzimu kwelubaka gungaba pakati napakati kwe awa. <verse eid="REV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2" />Ndakakobona batumwa bekudzimu balikutondeka banoma mbeli kweNdzimu, bakapiwa nyanga dzinolidziwa dzilikutondeka.<verse eid="REV 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3" />Umwe ntumwa wekudzimu wakahha akama mbeli kwetjibeso enatjiyenga tjezeezi, wakapiwa mhoza njinji kuti ahanganyise nemitembezelo yebakayengemala kuti zwipigwe pehhugwi kwetjibeso tjezeezi tjimbeli kwetjigalo tjobumambo. <verse eid="REV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4" />Busi gwemhoza gwakapfungayila kan'ompela nemitembezelo yebakayengemala kubva muluboko gwentumwa wekudzimu, mbeli kweNdzimu. <verse eid="REV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5" />Ipapo ntumwa wekudzimu wakatola tjiyenga akatjihhadza nemoto waakatola patjibeso akakuposela muhango, kwakaba netitima, nebomba, nepenya kwenthari netengenyeka kwehango.<verse eid="REV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyanga Dzinolidziwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6" />Batumwa bekudzimu balikutondeka baka bana nyanga dzilikutondeka bakazwibaakanya kuti batjilidza nyanga dzabo.<verse eid="REV 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7" />Ntumwa wekudzimu wekutanga wakalidza lunyanga gugwe, kukahha tjivulamabgwe nemoto wakahangana nemalopa, kwakaposegwa pehhugwi muhango lubabi gwembabi nhatu dzehango dzikatshwa, lubabi gwembabi nhatu dzemiti gukatshwa, buhwa gose gutema gukatshwa.<verse eid="REV 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8" />Ntumwa wekudzimu webubili wakalidza lunyanga gugwe, kumwe kunhu kunonga dombo gulugulu, lakalipfuta, nemoto kwakaposegwa mugungwa. Lubabi gwembabi nhatu dzegungwa kukahanduka kukaba malopa, <verse eid="REV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9" />lubabi gwembabi nhatu gwezwipuka dzezwinotjila zwinogala mugungwa zwikafa, nelubabi gwembabi nhatu gwezwikepe kukapaladziwa.<verse eid="REV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10" />Ntumwa wekudzimu webutatu wakalidza lunyanga gugwe, nyenyedzi whuluwhulu inopfuta setjivoneko yakawa ibva kuhhuhhugwi, yakawila palubabi gwembabi nhatu dzenjizi nemisenya yevula. <verse eid="REV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11" />Zina lenyenyedzi laka liyi, “Unobaba.” Lubabi gwembabi nhatu dzevula yakahanduka ikababa, banhu banjinji bakafa nentha yevula iyeyo ngobe yaka ibaba.<verse eid="REV 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12" />Ntumwa wekudzimu webuna wakalidza lunyanga gugwe, lubabi gwembabi nhatu dzehhuba gukabola, nelubabi gwembabi nhatu dzemwedzi, nelubabi gwembabi nhatu gwenyenyedzi, kuyetila kuti lubabi gwembabi nhatu gwezwinhu izwezwi zwakabahhalima, lubabi gwembabi dzilinhatu gwemasikati gwakagusina tjedza, kukajalobo nekulubabi gwembabi nhatu gwebusiku.<verse eid="REV 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13" />Ndakalinga ndikawha lumhangu gulila newhi gulugulu, pagwaka gupupuruka muhhuhhugwi guti, “Kwakababangalila! Kwakababangalila! Kwakababangalila ibabo banogala muhango, nentha yelidziwa kwenyanga kutjowhoyetiwa nebamwe batumwa bekudzimu batatu!”<verse eid="REV 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1" />Ntumwa wekudzimu webuhanu wakalidza lunyanga gugwe, ndakabona nyenyedzi yakayawa ibva pehhugwi ikawila muhango, yakapiwa khiyi dzegomba lisina palinopelela, <verse eid="REV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2" />wakahhula gomba lisina palinopelela, kukabhuda busi gunga gunoyi gobhuda mubibi lemoto wembvuto, hhuba nemhepo kwakaba hhalima nentha yebusi gunobva mugomba lisina palinopelela. <verse eid="REV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3" />Kukabhuda mhaho mubusi gwegomba dzikaba pehhugwi kwehango, mhaho dzakapiwa masimba anonga emhani dzehango. <verse eid="REV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4" />Dzakabudziwa kuti dzisikubadze buhwa gwehango kene miti kene tjipi zwatjo tjinomela, koga dzikubadze ibabo boga basina lutjayo gweNdzimu pamhahha dzabo. <verse eid="REV 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5" />Mhaho dzakabvumigwa gwadzisa banhu kwemimwedzi mihanu, koga adzizobvumigwa babulaya, gwadzisiwa ikoku kwakakunga gwadziwa hapa nhu alumwa nemhani. <verse eid="REV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6" />Mumahhuba iyawo banhu banowhohaka lufu koga abatowhoguwana, banowhohaka fa koga lufu gowhobatihha.<verse eid="REV 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7" />Mhaho dzaka dzinga mbizi dzinoyenda kungwa, mumiholo yadzo dzakadzakambala kunonga zwiyala zwezeezi, dzina buso gunonga gwebanhu, <verse eid="REV 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8" />dzaka dzina mavudzi anonga ebanhu betjikadzi, dzina meno anonga ehumba, <verse eid="REV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9" />pazwifuba dzaka dzina kunonga zwidzibililo zwetshipi pazwifuba, hhoba yemapapiro adzo yaka inga hhoba yedzi koloyi njinji dzinokwebewa nembizi dziyenda kungwa. <verse eid="REV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10" />Dzaka dzina mwise inoluma seyemhani, mumimwise iyeyo ndiko kwaka kunamasimba okubadza banhu kwemimwedzi mihanu. <verse eid="REV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11" />Dzinamambo upehhugwi kwadzo iye ntumwa wegomba lisina palinopelela, zina lile netjiHhebheru eyi Abhadoni, netjiGiriki unodanwa Apholoyoni.<verse eid="REV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12" />Mboli yekutanga yapinda, koga kowhotobela dzimwe mboli mbili hule kwayikoku.<verse eid="REV 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13" />Ntumwa wekudzimu webutanhatu wakalidza lunyanga gugwe, ndikawha whi libhuda munyanga dzilina dzetjibeso tjezeezi tjimbeli kweNdzimu, <verse eid="REV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14" />liti kuntumwa wekudzimu webutanhatu waka enalunyanga, “Sunungula batumwa bekudzimu bana bakasungiligwa pagwizi gukulukulu Yufuretisi.” <verse eid="REV 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15" />Batumwa bekudzimu ibabo baka baka baakanyigwa awa iyeyo, nehhuba ilelo, mwedzi iwhoyo, negole ilelo, kuti babulaye lubabi gwembabi nhatu dzebanhu. <verse eid="REV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16" />Ndakawha bunji gwebagwi baka bakatanha mbizi kuti baka bali mamiliyoni alimakhulu mabili. <verse eid="REV 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17" />Mumbono wangu ndakabona mbizi dzilisawhoku. Ibabo bakabakatanha mbizi baka bakambala zwidzibililo zwepafuba zwetshipi zwili zwihaba, kakale zwili zwembala wehhuhhugwi,nembala wesalifa miholo yembizi yakabe inga miholo yehumba mumilomo yadzo kwaka kubhuda moto, busi nesalifa. <verse eid="REV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18" />Lubabi gwembabi nhatu dzebanhu gwakabulawa nemboli nhatu idzedzi, moto, nebusi, nesalifa kwaka kubhuda mumilomo yembizi. <verse eid="REV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19" />Ngobe masimba embizi amumilomo yadzo, nemumimwise yawo, mwise yadzo yaka inga nyoka inamiholo, mbizi dzaka dzihingisa mwise iyeyo kuti dzikubadze banhu.<verse eid="REV 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20" />Banhu bose bakabe basala basakabulawa nemboli idzedzi, abazohanduka mumihingo yabo yabaka bethama nemaboko, kakale abazoletja namata meyambi, nemidzimwana yakabehhewa nezeezi, nesiliva, netshipi, nemabgwe, nemiti, isingabone, kene wha, kene yenda. <verse eid="REV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21" />Abazohanduka, kuti baletje bulaya kwabo, kene buloyi gwabo, kene bupombgwe, kene bubava gwabo.<verse eid="REV 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10" />
  <para style="s">Ntumwa Wekudzimu nelukwalo Gutukununu Gunopeteka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1" />Ndakabona umwe ntumwa wekudzimu unasimba ejita ebva kudzimu, akapombegwa negole nenlanlabungo ulipehhugwi kwen'holo uwe, buso gugwe gwaka gunga hhuba, makumbo awe aka enga mabibi emoto. <verse eid="REV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2" />Muluboko gugwe kwaka kuna lukwalo gutukununu gwakahhulika, wakatshamba negumbo lile loludli pehhugwi kwegungwa, lelumehwe likatshamba pehhugwi kwehango, <verse eid="REV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3" />wakadanilila newhi gulugulu laka linga bomba kwehumba, paakadanilila titima kulikutondeka kwakadabila. <verse eid="REV 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4" />Titima kulikutondeka kwakati kwadabila, ndaka ndohaka kwala, koga ndikawha whi libva kudzimu liti, “zwina zwinhu zwalebgwa netitima kulikutondeka, usizwikwale pasi.”<verse eid="REV 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5" />Ntumwa wekudzimu wandakandabona alimile pehhugwi kwegungwa nange pehhugwi kwehango, wakamilidzila luboko gugwe goludli kudzimu. <verse eid="REV 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6" />Wakatuna nayiye unotjila nekusingapele, wakabumba kudzimu nezwimukati kwekudzimu, nehango nezwimukati kwehango, negungwa nayiko kose kumukati akati, “Kusitjabe nenonoka kakale. <verse eid="REV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7" />Koga mumahhuba ewhi ledanilila kwelunyanga gwalidziwa nentumwa wekutondeka, tjakasumbikika tjeNdzimu tjaakabudza balanda babe balebesambeli tjakafanila hhadzisika.”<verse eid="REV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8" />Whi landakawha lilebeleka nemi libva kudzimu, lakakolebeleka kakale nemi liti, “Yenda unotola lukwalo gwakahhulika gumu luboko wentumwa wekudzimu umile pehhugwi kwegungwa nange pehhugwi kwehango.”<verse eid="REV 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9" />Ndakayenda kuntumwa wekudzimu ndikati andipe lukwalo gutukununu, iye wakati kundili, “Ugutole ugudle, ntumbu uwo unowholuma, koga munlomo uwo gowhozipa sebutji.”<verse eid="REV 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10" />Ndakatola lukwalo gutukununu gubva muluboko gwentumwa wekudzimu, ndikagudla, munlomo wangu gwakazipa sebutji, koga ndakati ndagudla ntumbu wangu ukaluma. <verse eid="REV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11" />Ndakakobudziwa kuti, “Wakafanila lebesembeli kakale nekwebanhu banjinji, nekwenjudzi njinji, nekwendimi njinji, nabomambo banjinji.”<verse eid="REV 10:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11" />
  <para style="s">Basupi Babili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1" />Ndakapiwa lukuni gwaka gunga lundzi goyela, ndakabudziwa kuti, “Milika uyende unoyela thempeli yeNdzimu, netjibeso, kakale ubale ibabo banonamata mukati. <verse eid="REV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2" />Koga usiyele lubahhe gukuhhe kwethempeli ugusiye ngobe gwakapiwa Bataya, banowhotshamba munzi-nkulu wakayengemala kwemimwedzi ilimakumi mana anamimwedzi mibili. <verse eid="REV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3" />Ndowhopa basupi bangu babili masimba elebesambeli kwemahhuba alitjiwulu tjina makhulu mabili anamahhuba makumi matanhatu bakambala masaka.”<verse eid="REV 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4" />Ibaba ndiyo miti yemitoba mibili nezwigadziko zwezwivoneko zwibili zwimile mbeli kwaHe wehango. <verse eid="REV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5" />Hapa kuna nhu unohaka bakubadza, kobhuda moto mumilomo yabo, ukopisa babengi babo, nezila iyeyi ke bose banohaka bakubadza banobulawa sayikoku. <verse eid="REV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6" />Banamasimba ehhalila kuhhuhhugwi kuyetila kuti vula isine mumahhuba elebesambeli kwabo, banoba banamasimba ehandula vula ibamalopa, kakale bana masimba eloba hango kene nayipi zwayo mboli pose pabanoba behaka.<verse eid="REV 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7" />Bapedza pa busupi gwabo gose, tjibanda tjinobhuda mugomba lisina kwalinopelela, tjowhogwa nabo, tjikabakunda tjikaba bulaya. <verse eid="REV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8" />Mitumbi yabo inowholadzikiwa muzila yenzi-nkulu, nzi-nkulu iwhoyo mumeya udanwa uyi iSodoma neIgipita, ndiko kwakakowhomegwa He wabo patjileyanyo. <verse eid="REV 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9" />Bamwe banobva munjudzi dzose, nemundimi dzose, netjaba tjose, banowholingilila mitumbi yabo kwemahhuba matatu negaswa, besingabvume kuti mitumbi yabo ibiganyiwe mukumbu. <verse eid="REV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10" />Banhu bagele muhango banowhohanha pehhugwi kwefa kwabo, banowhohanhisisa bepana zwipo, ngobe balebesambeli ibaba babili baka bedziyidza ibabo bagele muhango. <verse eid="REV 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11" />Hule kwemahhuba matatu anagaswa meya yebupenyu inobva kuNdzimu yakabangina bakamilika bakama nemakumbo abo, ibabo bakababona bakawigwa nehla kukulu. <verse eid="REV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12" />Bakawha whi gulugulu libva kudzimu liti kubali, “Hhani ngeno!” bakatogwa negole bakayenda pehhugwi kudzimu, babengi babo bakaba linga. <verse eid="REV 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13" />Nelubaka igogo kwakaba netengenyeka kwehango kukulu, lubabi gwembabi dziligumi dzenzi-nkulu gukakolomoka, kukafa banhu bali zwiwulu zwilikutondeka, bose bakasala bakawigwa nehla kukulukulu bakapa gudzo kuNdzimu wekudzimu.<verse eid="REV 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14" />Mboli yebubili yakapinda, koga yebutatu inohha nekulibilidza.<verse eid="REV 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lunyanga Gwekutondeka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15" />Ntumwa wekudzimu wekutondeki waka lidza lunyanga gugwe, kwakaba nemawhi makulukulu kudzimu aka eti, “Bumambo gwehango gwatjibebumambo gwaHe wedu negwaKhirisitu uwe, unowhotonga nekusingapele.” <verse eid="REV 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16" />Bawhola bali makumi mabili nebana, baka baligele muzwigalo zwabo zwebumambo mbeli kweNdzimu, bakakotama bakanamata Ndzimu <verse eid="REV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17" />beti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">“Tomuboka imwi He Ndzimu imwi weMasimba Ose, uyapo, waka elipo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">ngobe matjitola masimba enyu makulu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">mukatanga tonga.<verse eid="REV 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18" />Njudzi dzaka hhala buhongola,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">koga gwenyu buhongola guka hha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">lubaka gwekuti bafi batongewe gwatjiswika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">negwekuti mupe mbhayilo balanda benyu, balebesambeli, nebakayengemala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">nayibabo banohla zina lenyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">batukununu nebakulu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">nepaladza ibabo banopaladza hango.”<verse eid="REV 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19" />Thempeli yeNdzimu ikudzimu yakahhugwa, kwakabon'wa muthempeli, arika yetjibvumilano, ipapo kwakatobela penya sekwenthari, nebomba netitima, netengenyeka kwehango netjivulamagwe, netjivulamabgwe tjikulu.<verse eid="REV 11:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12" />
  <para style="s">Nhu Wetjikadzi NeHangale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1" />Ipapo tjilakidzo tjikulukulu tjakazumbunugwa kudzimu, nhu wetjikadzi waka akambala hhuba, nemwedzi uli pasi kwemakumbo awe, akambala tjiyala tjenyenyedzi dziligumi nembili mun'holo uwe. <verse eid="REV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2" />Waka akazwisenga, wakamimila kwazokwazo, mumagwadzo etshibama, egwadziwa kwazo mutshibama kukwe.<verse eid="REV 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3" />Tjimwe tjilakidzo tjakazumbunugwa kudzimu, hangale habahaba yaka ina miholo ilikutondeka nenyanga dziligumi, pehhugwi kwemiholo iyeyo kwaka kuna zwiyala zwili kutondeka. <verse eid="REV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4" />Mwise wayo wakakuba lubabi gwembabi nhatu dzenyenyedzi dzekudzimu ikadziposela pasi muhango. Hangale yakama mbeli kwenkadzi waka ewhotshibama, iyeta kuti imidze mwana uwe unoba azwagwa, <verse eid="REV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5" />wakatshibama mwana wetjilume, unowhotonga njudzi dzose neswimbo yetshipi, koga mwana uwe wakadzamugwa akayendisiwa kuNdzimu, kutjigalo tjitje tjebumambo. <verse eid="REV 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6" />Wenkadzi iwhoyo wakatihha akayenda kutjilambanyika kwaka kuna bugalo gugwe gwakabaakanyiwa neNdzimu, kuti anotjengetewa kwemahhuba alitjiwulu tjinamahhuba makhulu mabili ana makumi matanhatu.<verse eid="REV 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7" />Kwakaba nengwa kudzimu, Mikhayeli nebatumwa babe bakayenda kunogwisana nehangale, hangale nebatumwa bayo bakagwa, <verse eid="REV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8" />koga hangale nebatumwa bayo bakakundiwa, kwakabe kusitjina bugalo gwabo kudzimu. <verse eid="REV 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9" />Hangale whuluwhulu yakaposegwa pasi, iyo nyoka whulukugwi, inoyi Diyabhori kene Satane, ntjebeli wehango yose, wakaposegwa pasi muhango, iye nebatumwa babe bakaposegwa pasi.<verse eid="REV 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10" />Ndakawha whi gululugulu kudzimu liti, “Ngwenu tjidziwa nemasimba nebumambo gweNdzimu wedu netonga kwaKhirisitu uwe kwatjihha, ngobe iwhoya waka epa nlandu hama dzedu, unogala ebapa nlandu mbeli kweNdzimu wedu siku nesikati waposegwa pasi. <verse eid="REV 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11" />Bakawunkunda nemalopa eMwizana, nangemawhi ebusupi gwabo, ngobe abazoda bupenyu gwabo kuswikila palufu. <verse eid="REV 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12" />Tjihanhani ke, imwi kudzimu nemwi banogala mo! Koga kuhango nekugungwa kwakayibangalalila, ngobe Satane wajitila kumuli nebuhongola gukulukulu, saku eziba kuti unalubaka guhomanana!”<verse eid="REV 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13" />Ngono hangale yakati ibona kuti yaposegwa pasi muhango, yakatatamila wetjikadzi iwhoya waka atshibama mwana wetjilume. <verse eid="REV 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14" />Wetjikadzi wakapiwa mapapiro mabili elumhangu gukulukulu kuti apupuruke etihha nyoka ayende kutjilambanyika, ayende kubugalo kuti anotjengetewa kwelubaka nezwibaka zwina gaswa lelubaka kwaasingaswikigwe nenyoka. <verse eid="REV 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15" />Nyoka yakapfa vula yaka iwunga seyegwizi, kuti itole wetjikadzi nenkubila. <verse eid="REV 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16" />Koga hango yakabhatsha wetjikadzi, hango yaka hama ikamidza gwizi gwakagwabhuda munlomo wehangale. <verse eid="REV 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17" />Hangale yakagwadziligwa wetjikadzi, ikamilika kuti inogwa nebamwe bose beludzi gwewetjikadzi, banotjengeta milayo yeNdzimu bakabhatilila busupi gwaYesu. <verse eid="REV 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 12:18" />Hangale yakama pehhugwi kwensetje wegungwa.<verse eid="REV 12:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13" />
  <para style="s">Zwibanda Zwibili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1" />Ndakabona tjibanda tjibhuda mugungwa, tjina nyanga dzili gumi nemiholo ilikutondeka, pehhugwi kwenyanga kuna zwiyala zwiligumi, pehhugwi kwemiholo kwaka kuna zina linotuka Ndzimu. <verse eid="REV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2" />Tjibanda tjandakabona tjaka tjinga ngwe, makumbo atjo aka enga makumbo ebhele, nlomo watjo unganlomo wehumba. Hangale yakapa tjibanda masimba ayo netjigalo tjayo tjobumambo netonga kukulu. <verse eid="REV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3" />Umwe n'holo watjo waka unabanga linobulaya, banga linobulaya lakapola, hango yose yaka tjenamisiwa netjibanda ika tobela tjibanda. <verse eid="REV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4" />Banhu bakanamata hangale, ngobe yaka yapa tjibanda masimba ayo, bakatembezela tjibanda beti, “Ndiyani wakafanana netjibanda, kakale ndiyani ungagwa natjo?”<verse eid="REV 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5" />Tjibanda tjakapiwa nlomo welebeleka mawhi ekuzwikudza nemasapa etuka Ndzimu, tjakabvumigwa hingisa masimba kwemimwedzi ili makumi mana nemibili, <verse eid="REV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6" />tjibanda tjakahhula nlomo watjo tjileba masapa kuNdzimu, tjituka zina lile, nebugalo gugwe, nebanogala kudzimu.<verse eid="REV 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7" />Tjakapiwa masimba ogwa nebayengemali, kakale kuti tjibakunde, kakale tjakapiwa masimba pehhugwi kwenjudzi dzose, nebanhu bose, nendimi dzose, nehango dzose, <verse eid="REV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8" />kakale bose bagele muhango banowhotjinamata, wose nhu unazina lisakakwagwa kusanhu kukasimulugwa hango mulukwalo gwebutjilo gweMwizana yakabhayiwa.<verse eid="REV 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9" />Unazebe ngaawhe. <verse eid="REV 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10" />Hapa kuna wakafanila ba ntapwa, unowhoyenda kubutapwa, hapa kuna wakafanila bulawa nebhangatjeke, unowhobulawa nebhangatjeke. Ikoku kohaka whililidzila nebugalimoyo kwebayengemali.<verse eid="REV 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11" />Ndakabona tjimwe tjibanda tjibhuda pasi kwehango, tjaka tjina nyanga mbili dzinonga dzemwizana tjaka tjilebeleka sehangale. <verse eid="REV 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12" />Tjakahingisa masimba ose etjibanda tjekutanga tjihinga tjakatjimilila, tjakathama hango nebanogala muyili kuti banamate tjibanda tjekutanga, tjinabanga lakagwilo tjibulaya laka lapola. <verse eid="REV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13" />Tjibanda tjebubili itjetji tjakathama makaabadzo makulukulu, kose nejitisa moto ubva kudzimu uhha muhango banhu bakalinga, <verse eid="REV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14" />tjakatjebela ibabo banogala muhango nemakaabadzo atjakabvumigwa thama mbeli kwetjibanda tjekutanga, tjiti ngababumbe tjibumbwa tjelemekedza tjibanda tjekutanga tjakatjakubadziwa nebhangatjeke koga tjikatjila. <verse eid="REV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15" />Tjibanda tjobubili tjakapiwa masimba ofemela bupenyu mutjibumbwa tjetjibanda tjokutanga, kwakathama kuti tjibumbwa tjilebeleke, kakale tjiyeta kuti bakabelamba namata tjibumbwa tjetjibanda babulawe. <verse eid="REV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16" />Tjakathama kuti banhu bose batukununu, nebakulu, bafumi nebahayi, bakasununguka nebalanda, basiwe lutjayo paluboko gweludli, kene pawhuma. <verse eid="REV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17" />Kuyetila kuti kusibe nenhu unowhotenga kene tengesa kuhhe kwawhoya unalutjayo, gwakamilila zina letjibanda kene mbalo yezina latjo.<verse eid="REV 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18" />Ikoku kohaka butjenjebvu, iwhoyo unowhisisa, ngaabhate mbalo wetjibanda, ngobe mbalo iyeyo yakamilila zina lonhu, mbalo iyeyo makulu matanhatu anamakumi matanhatu nekutanhatu (666).<verse eid="REV 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14" />
  <para style="s">Mwizana NeBanhu Bayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1" />Ndakalinga ndikabona Mwizana ilimile pehhugwi kwedombo leZiyoni, yaka ilimile nebanhu balizwiwulu zwili gulu zwina zwiwulu zwili makumi mana nezwina (144,000), baka bakakwagwa zina layo nelaTate bayo pawhuma dzabo. <verse eid="REV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2" />Kakale ndakawha whi libva kudzimu, laka liwhika sensindo wewona kwevula njinji kakale setitima sevula kukulu, whi landakawha lakaliwhika sehhoba yedende linolidziwa nebalidzi, <verse eid="REV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3" />bakabemba lumbo gutshwa belimbeli kwetjigalo tjebumambo, belimbeli kwezwipuka zwinotjila zwina, nambeli kwebawhola. Akuna engadiyika lumbo igogo kuhhe kwayibo bali zwiwulu zwili gulu nemakumi mana ezwiwulu nezwina (144,000) baka bawangugwa kubva muhango. <verse eid="REV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4" />Ibaba ndibo basakatongozwilonga hambgwa nebakadzi, ngobe bakazwitjengeta bali babuya, ibaba ndibo banotobela Mwizana kose kwayinoyenda, bakabvubugwa pakati kwebanhu, beli mitjelo yekutanga kuNdzimu nekuMwizana. <verse eid="REV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5" />Mumilomo yabo akuzotongowanika manyepwa, ngobe abana tjibi.<verse eid="REV 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Batumwa bekudzimu Batatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6" />Ndakakobona umwe ntumwa wekudzimu ewuluka kuhhuhhugwi, waka ana ndebo mbuya inogala nekusingapele kuti ayisumikile kuna ibabo bagele muhango, kuhango dzose, kunjudzi dzose, kundimi dzose, nekubanhu bose, <verse eid="REV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7" />wakati newhi lipehhugwi, “Lemekedzani Ndzimu, kakale muwumpe gudzo, ngobe lubaka gwetonga kukwe gwaswika, namatani iye wakathama kudzimu nehango, negungwa nemisenya yevula.<verse eid="REV 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8" />Umwe ntumwa wekudzimu webubili wakatobela eti, “Bhabhiloni lawa, wawa iwo nzi-nkulu, iwo wakathama kuti njudzi dzose dzin'we wayini yenjemulo dzawo dzisakalulama.”<verse eid="REV 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9" />Ntumwa wekudzimu webutatu wakabatobela eti newhi lipehhugwi, “Hapa umwe nhu enamata tjibanda netjibumbwa tjatjo, kakale ebvuma siwa lutjayo gwatjo pawhuma kene paluboko, <verse eid="REV 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10" />iwhoyo nhu unowhon'wa wayini yebuhongola gweNdzimu, inodulugwa munkombe webuhongola gugwe isina tjayakahanganyisiwa natjo, kakale unowhowhisiwa zogwadza nemoto nesalifa mbeli kwebatumwa bekudzimu bakayengemala nambeli kweMwizana. <verse eid="REV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11" />Nebusi gwewhisiwa zogwadza kwabo gowhomilika gunda pehhugwi nekusingapele, ibaba banonamata tjibanda netjibumbgwa tjatjo nakene unolongwa lutjayo gwezina letjibanda abatowhoba nenyaluluka, siku nesikati.<verse eid="REV 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12" />Ikoku kohaka dzikitidza kwebayengemali, ibabo banotjengeta milayo yeNdzimu, kakale begalamoyo munaYesu.<verse eid="REV 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13" />Ndakakowha whi libva kudzimu liti, “Kwala whoku. Bakakombolegwa bafi banofila munaHe kubvila ngwenuwali.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 14:13">Meya yakati, “Bakakombolegwa kwelebeswa, kudze kuti banyaluluke muhinga kwabo, ngobe zwiyeto zwabo zobatobela!”<verse eid="REV 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kowewha Kwehango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14" />Ndakalinga, ndikabona gole jena mbeli kwangu, pehhugwi kwalo kwaka kuligele umwe unonga Nkololo wenhu, waka ana tjiyala tjezeezi pan'holo uwe, muluboko gugwe kwaka kuna mpanga unopiza. <verse eid="REV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15" />Umwe ntumwa wekudzimu wakabhuda muThempeli, emimilila iwhoya waka eligele pehhugwi kwegole, “Tjeka nempanga uwo ukowhe, ngobe lubaka gokowha gwaswika, zwidlo zwimuhango zwayibva.” <verse eid="REV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16" />Iwhoya waka eligele pehhugwi kwegole, waka zunguza mpanga uwe muhango, hango yakakowhewa.<verse eid="REV 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17" />Umwe ntumwa wekudzimu wakabhuda muThempeli yekudzimu, iyebo waka akabhata mpanga unopiza.<verse eid="REV 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18" />Umwe ntumwa wekudzimu wakabhuda ebva mutjibeso tjepisila zwibhayilo, ntumwa wakabe n'hingo uwe uli welinga moto, wakamimilila iwhoya waka akabhata mpanga unopiza eti, “Tjeka nempanga, ukubunganye nhabi dzemihhambi imuhango, ngobe mahhambi atjiyibva.” <verse eid="REV 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19" />Ntumwa wekudzimu wakazunguza mpanga uwe muhango akakubunganya mahhambi amuhango, akawaposela mutjiswino tjemahhambi tjikulukulu tjebuhongola gweNdzimu. <verse eid="REV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20" />Tjiswino tjemahhambi tjakaswinigwa kuhhe kwenzi-nkulu, malopa akabhuda mutjiswino, eyenda pehhugwi kungaswika pantshibha wembizi, ewunga gwendo gungaba makhilomitha ali makulu matatu.<verse eid="REV 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15" />
  <para style="s">Batumwa Bekudzimu Banamboli Dzekupedzisila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1" />Ndakabona tjimwe tjilakidzilo kudzimu, tjikulukulu kakale tjinotjenamisa. Ndakabona batumwa bekudzimu bali kutondeka benamboli dzilikutondeka, dzili dzekupedzisila, ngobe mudzili buhongola gweNdzimu gowhopelela ipapo.<verse eid="REV 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2" />Ndakabona kwakakunga gungwa legilazi lakahanganyisiwa nemoto, nayibabo bakakunda tjibanda netjibumbwa tjatjo nelutjayo gwatjo nembalo wezina latjo, bakabelimile pagungwa legilazi, bakabhata matende eNdzimu mumaboko abo, <verse eid="REV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3" />bemba lumbo gwaMozisi, nlanda weNdzimu, nelumbo gweMwizana beti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">“Mihingo yenyu mikulu kakale inotjenamisa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">imwi He, Ndzimu Wemasimba ose!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">Zila dzenyu dzakalulama kakale ndedzemalebeswa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">imwi Mambo wenjudzi dzose!<verse eid="REV 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4" />Ndiyani usingake akamulemekedza kakale usingake akakudza zina lenyu, imwi He?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">nekuti ndimwi moga makayengemala.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Njudzi dzose dzowhohha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">dzikawhomunamata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">ngobe mihingo yenyu yakalulama yatjizumbunugwa.”<verse eid="REV 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5" />Hule kwayikoku ndakalinga ndikabona thempeli yekudzimu yakahhugwa, iyo thempeli yejatja letjibvumilano, <verse eid="REV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6" />batumwa bekudzimu balikutondeka bakabhuda muthempeli, bana mboli dzilikutondeka, baka bakambala zwiyambalo zwejila lelineni linopenyelela, zwifuba zwabo zwakasungwa nemimwandabula yezeezi. <verse eid="REV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7" />Tjimwe tjezwipuka zwinotjila zwina tjakaswiswa batumwa bekudzimu balikutondeka ndigwana dzezeezi dzilihhele buhongola gweNdzimu unotjila nekusingapele, <verse eid="REV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8" />thempeli yakahhala busi gunobva mugudzo leNdzimu nemumasimba awe, akuna nhu wakatubula ngina muthempeli kuswikila mboli dzilikutondeka dzebatumwa bekudzimu balikutondeka dzapela.<verse eid="REV 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16" />
  <para style="s">Ndigwana Dzinabuhongola GweNdzimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1" />Ndakawha whi gulugulu libva muthempeli libudza batumwa bekudzimu balikutondeka liti, “Tjiyendani munodulula muhango ndigwana dzinabuhongola gweNdzimu.”<verse eid="REV 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2" />Ntumwa wekudzimu wekutanga wakayenda akanodululila muhango ndigwana iye, banhu baka banalutjayo gwetjibanda benamata tjibumbgwa tjatjo bakamela malonda akayipa kakale anopanda.<verse eid="REV 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3" />Ntumwa weNdzimu webubili wakadululila mugungwa ndigwana iye. Vula yakahanduka ikaba selopa lenhu wakafa, kose kwakakutjila mugungwa kwakafa.<verse eid="REV 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4" />Ntumwa weNdzimu webutatu wakadululila ndigwana iye munjizi nemadonsa evula, zwakahanduka zwikaba malopa. <verse eid="REV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5" />Ndakawha ntumwa wekudzimu waka akalingisana nekwevula eti, “Makatambunuka imwi mukutonga kwenyu ikoku, imwi Makayengemala, imwi uyapo kakale waka elipo. <verse eid="REV 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6" />Ngobe banhu bakatebula malopa ebayengemali neebalebesambeli, ndizo makabapa malopa kuti ban'we. Ikoku kwakabafanila!” <verse eid="REV 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7" />Ndakawha limwe whi libva patjibeso liti, “Ndiko ikoko He, Ndzimu, imwi Wemasimba ose, tonga kwenyu ndekwelebeswa, kakale kwakatambunuka.”<verse eid="REV 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8" />Ntumwa weNdzimu webuna wakadululila ndigwana iye pehhugwi kwehhuba, hhuba lakabvumigwa pisa banhu nemoto, <verse eid="REV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9" />banhu bakatshwa nentha yepisa kukulukulu, bakalonga bhiso zina leNdzimu, iye waka enamasimba pehhugwi kwemboli dzose idzedzi, kakale abazohanduka kubva kumatjinyo abo bekawunkudza.<verse eid="REV 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10" />Ntumwa weNdzimu webuhanu wakadululila ndigwana iye pehhugwi kwetjigalo tjobumambo tjetjibanda, bumambo gwetjibanda gukaba muhhalima, banhu bakazwiluma ndimi nentha yegwadziwa, <verse eid="REV 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11" />bakalonga bhiso Ndzimu wekudzimu nentha yemalonda abo negwadziwa kwabo, koga abazohanduka kuti basiye mihingo yabo mibi.<verse eid="REV 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12" />Ntumwa wekudzimu wobutanhatu wakadululila ndigwana iye mugwizi gukulu gunoyi Yufuretisi, vula yago ikapwa, kuyetila kuti kubaakanyiwe zila yabomambo banowhohha bebva kunobhuda hhuba. <verse eid="REV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13" />Ipapo ndakabona meya nhatu dzinahambgwa dzaka dzinga mahhula. Dzakadzibhuda munlomo wehangale, nemunlomo wenlebesambeli wemanyepwa. <verse eid="REV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14" />Idzedzi imeya dzemeyambi, dzinoyeta makaabadzo, meya idzedzi nhatu dzoyenda kunabomambo behango dzose, dzibakubunganyila ngwa yehhuba gulu leNdzimu Wemasimba Ose.<verse eid="REV 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15" />“Whililani, ndohha sembava! Wakakombolegwa unogala akalinga, elondolodza zwiyambalo zwizwe kuyetila kuti asiyende akati piti banhu bebona bumbudlo gugwe!”<verse eid="REV 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16" />Kakale meya idzedzo dzakakubunganya bomambo panhu pan'ompela pabugalo gunoyi Aramagidiyoni nelulimi gwetjiHhebheru.<verse eid="REV 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17" />Ntumwa wekudzimu wekubutondeka wakadululila ndigwana iye mumhepo, whi gulugulu lakabhuda libva muthempeli, patjigalo tjobumambo liti, “Kwapela.” <verse eid="REV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18" />Kwakaba nepenya kwenthari, nebomba, netitima kwevula, netengenyeka kwehango kukulukulu kunotjenamisa, kusakatongobeyapo muhango kwetjingabanhu kwabakabumbiwa muhango, tengenyeka ikoku kwakaba kunjisa. <verse eid="REV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19" />Nzi-nkulu wakapaluka ukaba zwikamu zwitatu, mizi-mikulu yehango ikapalala, Ndzimu wakaalakana Bhabhiloni linamasimba, akalin'wisa nkombe wewayini yebuhongola gugwe. <verse eid="REV 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20" />Zwigwizi zose zwimu gungwa zwakatihha, matombo ose akahayika, <verse eid="REV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21" />mabgwe makulukulu etjivulamabgwe, limwe nelimwe bgwe lakalinansindo ungalizana nemakhilogiremu ali makumi mana anamahanu, akawila banhu ebva kudzimu, banhu bakalonga bhiso Ndzimu nentha yemboli yetjivulamabgwe, mboli iyeyo yaka ihlisa kwazo.<verse eid="REV 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17" />
  <para style="s">Fukula Inozibgwa kwazo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1" />Umwe webatumwa bekudzimu bali kutondeka waka enandigwana dzilikutondeka wakahha kundili akati, “Hha ngeno ndikulakidze kuti fukula inozibgwa kwazo, igele pehhugwi kwevula njinji, inowholangiwa tjini, <verse eid="REV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2" />bomambo behango bakayeta nayo bupombgwe, nebanhu behango bakalaladza nentha yen'wa wayini yayo yebupombgwe.”<verse eid="REV 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3" />Ntumwa wekudzimu wakandisenga ndikayenda kutjilambanyika ndili muMeya, ndakabona wetjikadzi eligele pehhugwi kwetjibanda tjihaba, tjilihhele mazina anotuka Ndzimu, tjaka tjina miholo ilikutondeka, nenyanga dzili gumi. <verse eid="REV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4" />Nkadzimayi waka akambala zwiyambalo zwinambala welubende nen'haba, akazwinjenjemesa nezeezi nemabgwe anantengo upehhugwi nendalama, muluboko gugwe waka akabhata nkombe uhhele zwinohemesa, nehambgwa yebupombgwe gugwe, <verse eid="REV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5" />pawhuma iye, kwaka kwakakwagwa zina linoleba tjakasumbikika. “Bhabhiloni whuluwhulu, mayi befukula dzose nemihingo yose yehango inohemesa.” <verse eid="REV 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6" />Ndakabona nkadzimayi iwhoyu akalaladza nentha yemalopa ebayengemali nangemalopa ebakabulawa ngentha yaYesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 17:6">Pandakawumbona ndakakaabala kwazo kwazo. <verse eid="REV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7" />Koga ntumwa wekudzimu wakati kundili, “Ngentha yeni wakaabala? Ndowhokubudza tjakasumbikika tjenkadzimayi iwhoyu, netjakasumbikika tjetjibanda tjakawunsenga, tjinamiholo ilikutondeka nenyanga dzili gumi. <verse eid="REV 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8" />Tjibanda tjawakabona, tjakatongobayapo, atjitjipo, tjowhobhuda mugomba lisina palinoma tjinopaladziwa, ibabo bagele muhango benamazina asakakwagwa mulukwalo gobupenyu kubvila pakabumbiwa kwehango, banowhotjenama bebona tjibanda, ngobe tjakatongobayapo, ngwenu atjitjipo, koga tjowhohha kakale.<verse eid="REV 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9" />Whoku kohaka nkumbulo unabutjenjebvu. Miholo ili kutondeka ndiwo matombo alikutondeka agegwe nenkadzimayi iwhoyu, <verse eid="REV 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10" />kakale ndibo bomambo balikutondeka, bahanu babo bakatjipinda, umwe wabo uyapo, umwe haanhu akahha, unowhoti ahha, wakafanila tonga kwelubakanyana. <verse eid="REV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11" />Tjibanda tjakatongoba tjiliyapo, tjakatjipinda, ndiye mambo webuhhanakadzi koga ali umwe webalikutondeka, kakale tjowhopaladziwa.<verse eid="REV 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12" />Nyanga dzili gumi dzawakabona ndibomambo baligumi basanhu bakawamutjila bumambo, koga banowhowamutjila masimba etonga kwelubakanyana gunonga awa in'ompela, kan'ompela netjibanda. <verse eid="REV 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13" />Ibaba bose banakumbulo un'ompela, banopa tjibanda masimba abo nesimba labo letonga. <verse eid="REV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14" />Banowhomusa ngwa begwisana neMwizana, koga Mwizana inowhobakunda, ngobe ndiye He wabohe naMambo wabomambo, ibabo banaye bakadan'wa kakale bakahagwa kakale banogalamoyo.”<verse eid="REV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15" />Ntumwa wekudzimu wakati kundili, “Vula dzawakabona, pagele fukula, ndibo banhu, nemabunga ebanhu, nenjudzi nendimi. <verse eid="REV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16" />Nyanga dzili gumi dzawakabona netjibanda banowhohema fukula, banowhoyihakadza bakayisiya ilimbudlo, banowhodla nyama yayo bakayipisa nemoto, <verse eid="REV 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17" />ngentha yekuti Ndzimu wakakusa mumimoyo yabo kuti bahhadzise tjinangwa tjitje neba nenkumbulo un'ompela kose nepa tjibanda masimba abo etonga, kuswikila mawhi eNdzimu ahhadzisika.”<verse eid="REV 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18" />“Nkadzimayi wawakabona ndiwo iwhoya nzi-nkulu unotonga bomambo behango.”<verse eid="REV 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18" />
  <para style="s">Wa KweBhabhiloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1" />Hule kwayikoku ndakabona umwe ntumwa wekudzimu ejita ebva kudzimu, enamasimba kwazo, hango yakaba netjedza nentha yepenya kukwe. <verse eid="REV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2" />Wakadanilila newhi gulugulu eti, “Lawa, Lawa, ilo Bhabhiloni gulugulu! Latjibe bugalo gwemeyambi, neguwhu lemeya dzose dzehambgwa, neguwhu lenyunyi dzose dzinohemesa dzina hambgwa. <verse eid="REV 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3" />Ngobe njudzi dzose dzakan'wa wayini yenjemulo dzebupombgwe gwalo, bomambo behango bakathama bupombgwe nalo, bemuhango banoyingidza zwinhu zwabo bakafumisiwa nefumwa yesazwibhata kwalo.”<verse eid="REV 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4" />Ndakawha limwe whi libva kudzimu liti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:4">“Bhudani mulili, banhu bangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">kuyetila kuti musidlidzane nalo mumatjinyo alo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">kuyetila kuti musiwigwe bo nemboli dzaliwila,<verse eid="REV 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5" />ngobe matjinyo alo akabutitikiwa akanoswika pehhugwi kudzimu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:5">ndizo Ndzimu waalakana matjinyo alo.<verse eid="REV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6" />Mulibhate nezila yalakamubhata nayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">mulibgwilizile mihingo yalo nezila yakapamhiwa kabili,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:6">mulidilile mikombe mibili</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">yenkombe yalakamudilila.<verse eid="REV 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7" />Muliwhise zogwadza nebuyendasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">kwakalizana nezila yalakalizwikudza nayo neyalakalitjila zwakanaka nayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">‘Ndigele samambokadzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">andita tjilikadzi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">andingafe ndaziba dziyila.”<verse eid="REV 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8" />Ndizo ke mboli dzalo dzowhohha muhhuba lin'ompela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">bugwele, lila nebhamba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:8">Lowhopisiwa nemoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">ngobe He Ndzimu unamasimba unowholitonga.”<verse eid="REV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9" />Bomambo behango bakabethama bupombgwe nalo, betjila zwinozipa nalo, banowhokuwa bakalililila hapa bebona busi gwetshwa kwalo. <verse eid="REV 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10" />Banowhoma kulekule, ngobe behla dziyidziwa kwalo, beti, “Kwakakubangalalila! Kwakakubangalalila iwe nzi-nkulu unamasimba, iwe Bhabhiloni! Mu awa in'ompela tongwa kuko kwakuswikila.”<verse eid="REV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11" />Bayingidzi benhundu bemuhango, banowhokuwa beyililila ngobe kusitjina nhu unotenga nhundu dzabanoyingidza, <verse eid="REV 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12" />nhundu dzezeezi, dzesiliva, dzemabgwe anantengo upehhugwi nendalama; nhundu dzejila lelineni lakanakisa, nejila lembala welubende, nejila linopenyelela, nejila haba; nemakwasayila ose akasima anonhuwilila, nezwinhu zose zwakabehhewa nenyanga, nezwekuni zwakabehhewa nemiti inantengo upehhugwi; nezwakabehhewa nemhangula, nezwakabehhewa netshipi, nezwakabehhewa nemabgwe, <verse eid="REV 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13" />nenhundu dzesinamoni, nemithariyo, nemhoza, nemure, nenyonje, newayini, nemafuta entoba, nebgwisa gwetjinkwa, nezwidlo, nen'ombe nemwizi, nembizi, nekoloyi, nebalanda kose kene nebupenyu gwebanhu. <verse eid="REV 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14" />“Mitjelo yawaka uyemula nemoyo yatjibva pakuli, nefumwa iyo yose nekwakanaka kuko kose kwapalala awungatjakuwane kakale!” <verse eid="REV 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15" />Bayingidzi bezwinhu izwezwi, bakafumisiwa nayilo, banowhoma kule, behla dziyidziwa kwalo. Banowholila bakakuwa kwazo, <verse eid="REV 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16" />beti, “Kwakakubangalalila, kwakakubangalalila, nzi-nkulu unkulunkulu waka unga nkadzimayi wakambala zwiyambalo zwejila lelineni lakanakisa lembala welubende nen'haba, wakanjenjemisiwa zeezi nemabgwe anantengo upehhugwi nendalama! <verse eid="REV 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17" />Mu awa in'ompela bufumi gose igogu gwapaladziwa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 18:17">Bose balawuli bezwikepe, nebakatanha kepe, nebanohinga muzwikepe, nebanotjila neyingidza muzwikepe, bakama kule. <verse eid="REV 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18" />Bakalila pabakabona busi gwepfuta kukwe beti, “Kwakatongoba nenzi-nkulu unonga sa iwhoyu?” <verse eid="REV 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19" />Bakazwidila whuluba mumiholo, bekuwa beti, “Kwakakubangalalila, kwakakubangalalila nzi-nkulu, waka ufumisa nefumwa iyo bose bakabenazwikepe zwimugungwa! Mu awa in'ompela wapaladziwa.<verse eid="REV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20" />Kudzimu ngakuhanhile tjayetika kuwunli, kuhanhe kan'ompela namwi bayengemali nebapositoli nebalebesambeli, ngobe Ndzimu wawutonga nentongo iwo zwawo nzi-nkulu wawakamutonga nawo!”<verse eid="REV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21" />Ntumwa wekudzimu unamasimba wakanunga bgwe linonga gwiyo gulugulu akaliposela mugungwa, eti, “Ndiyo zwayo zila Bhabhiloni nzi-nkulu, wayinowhoposegwa pasi nebuhongola, kakale ayitjowhopamha ikawanika, <verse eid="REV 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22" />Hhoba yebanhu banolidza dende neyebanomba, neyebanolidza nyele nebanolidza lunyanga, ayitjowhopamha ikawhika mukuli iwe nzi-nkulu, banabumhihha kene gwawupi zwawo n'hingo wemaboko abatjowhowanikwa munzi iwhoyu, nsindo webanhu banokhwa awutjopamha ukawhika munzi iwhoyu. <verse eid="REV 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23" />Tjedza tjetjivoneko, atjitjowhopamha tjikapenya imomu; newhi lenkwaha nelenlongo alingatjapamhe likawhika imomu, ngobe bayingidzi babo baka bali banhu banamasimba muhango, kakale nenjudzi dzose dzakatjebegwa nemalipa awo emanyepwa.<verse eid="REV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24" />Ngobe muBhabhiloni kwakawanika malopa ebalebesambeli neebayengemali, neebanhu bose bakabulawa muhango.<verse eid="REV 18:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1" />Hule kwayikoku ndakawha tjinonga whi gulugulu lebanhu banjinji bakudzimu, limimila liti, “Haleluya! Jidzo negudzo nemasimba ndekweNdzimu wedu. <verse eid="REV 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2" />Ngobe tonga kukwe ndekwelebeswa kakale kwakatambunuka, wakawana nlandu fukula whulu iyeya yakatjinya hango nebupombgwe gwayo, wakabgwilizila kuyili ngentha yemalopa ebalanda babe.” <verse eid="REV 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3" />Kakale bakapamha beti, “Haleluya! Busi gwepfuta kukwe goyenda pehhugwi nekusingapele.” <verse eid="REV 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4" />Bawhola bali makumi mabili nebana, nezwipuka zwinotjila zwina bakawila pasi, bakalumbidza Ndzimu ugele patjigalo tjebuMambo, baka beti, “Akujalo! Haleluya!”<verse eid="REV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nzano Webukwe GweMwizana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5" />Kwakawhika whi libva patjigalo tjebumambo liti, “Lumbidzani Ndzimu wedu, imwi balanda babe bose, imwi munowunhla, bakulu nebatukununu.” <verse eid="REV 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6" />Ndakakowha kwakakunga whi lebanhu banjinji, sewona kwevula njinji, kunga titima kwevula, liti, “Haleluya! Ngobe He Ndzimu wedu iye Wemasimba ose unotonga. <verse eid="REV 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7" />Ayihanheni, tihanhisise, tiwunkudze, ngobe bukwe gweMwizana gwaswika, nlongo uwe watjizwilulamisa, <verse eid="REV 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8" />wakabvumigwa kuti ambale tjiyambalo tjakanaka tjejila lelineni, linopenya kakale libuyanana.” (Ngobe zwiyambalo zwakanaka ndizo zwiyeto zwakakalulama zwebayengemali.)<verse eid="REV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9" />Ntumwa wekudzimu wakati kundili, “Kwala whoku, Bakakombolegwa ibabo bakakokewa kutjilayilo tjebukwe gweMwizana.” Kakale wakati kundili “Iyawa matama elebesawa eNdzimu.”<verse eid="REV 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10" />Ipapo ndakapfigama pamakumbo awe kuti ndiwunamate, koga iye wakati kundili, “Usithame ujalo! Imi ndinlanda sawe nemakamu awo akasenga busupi nekwa Yesu. Namata Ndzimu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 19:10">Ngobe busupi nekwaYesu ndiyo meya yebulebesambeli.<verse eid="REV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntaswi Wembizi Njhena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 1:1">Eze 1.1</ref>.</char>
    </note> Ndakabona kudzimu kwakahhulika, ndikabona mbizi njhena! Waka akayitanha unoyi Bugalimoyo neMalebeswa, unotonga, kakale egwa ngwa mukululama. <verse eid="REV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.12 </char><char style="xq" closed="false">Meho awe aka enga moto unopfuta, pehhugwi kwenholo uwe waka enazwiyala zwinjinji, waka enazina laka kwagwa lisigazibgwe nonhu kuhhe kwaiye. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 10:6">Dan 10.6</ref>.</char></note>Meho awe aka enga moto unopfuta, pehhugwi kwen'holo uwe waka enazwiyala zwinjinji, waka enazina lakakwagwa lisigazibgwe nonhu kuhhe kukwe. <verse eid="REV 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13" />Waka akambala tjiyambalo tjakabvubikiwa mumalopa, zina laanodan'wa nalo unoyi “Dama leNdzimu.” <verse eid="REV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14" />Makubungano ebagwi bengwa ekudzimu, akambala zwiyambalo zwejila lelineni lakanaka, zwitjena zwibuyanana, akawuntobela akatanha mbizi njhena. <verse eid="REV 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:9">Njimb 2.9</ref>.</char></note> Munlomo uwe kwakabhuda bhangatjeke linopiza laanowhokunda nalo njudzi dzose, unowhodzitonga neswimbo yetshipi, unowhoswina tjiswino tjewayini tjebuhongola gweNdzimu iye Wemasimba ose. <verse eid="REV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Matam 10.17</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 2:47">Dan 2.47</ref>.</char></note> Patjiyambalo tjitje nepatjidzwa tjitje kwaka kwakakwagwa zina linoyi, “Mambo wabomambo, He wabohe.”<verse eid="REV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19.17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 39:4">Eze 39.4</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 39:17-20">17-20</ref>.</char>
    </note>Ndakabona ntumwa wekudzimu alimile muhhuba, iye wakadanilila kunyunyi dzose dzinopururuka muhhuhhugwi newhi lipehhugwi eti, “Ihhani mukubunganile tjilayilo tjikulu tjeNdzimu, <verse eid="REV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18" />muwhodla mitumbi yabomambo, neyebalawuli bebagwi bengwa, neyebalume banamasimba, nenyama yembizi, nemitumbi yebanodzitanha, neyebanhu bose, bakasunununguka nebalanda, bose bakulu nebatukununu.”<verse eid="REV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19" />Ndakabona tjibanda, nabomambo behango nebagwi babo bengwa bakakubungana kuti bagwe na iwhoya wakatanha mbizi nebagwi babe bengwa. <verse eid="REV 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20" />Tjibanda tjakatapwa tjakaposegwa mubibi lemoto unopfuta wesalifa, panhu pan'ompela nenlebesambeli wemanyepwa waka ethama matjenamiso mbeli kwatjo, waka etjebela ibabo baka bena lutjayo gwetjibanda nayibabo baka benamata tjibubgwa tjatjo. <verse eid="REV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21" />Bamwe bose bakabulawa nebhangatjeke lakalibhuda munlomo uwe iwhoya waka akatanha mbizi, nyunyi dzose dzakadla mitumbi yabo dzikaguta.<verse eid="REV 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20" />
  <para style="s">Makole alitjiwuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1" />Ndakabona ntumwa wekudzimu ejita ebva kudzimu, akabhata khii yekugomba lisina palinopelela, neketane whuluwhulu muluboko gugwe. <verse eid="REV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2" />Wakabhata hangale nemasimba, iyo nyoka yantolo, inoyi Mvanganyi iye Satane, wakawunsunga kwemakole ali tjiwulu. <verse eid="REV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3" />Ntumwa wekudzimu wakaposela Satane mugomba, wakahhalila akalibuwa kuti asitjapamhe tjebela njudzi kakale, kuswikila makole alitjiwulu apela. Hule kwayikoko wakafanila sunungugwa kwelubakanyana.<verse eid="REV 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20.4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:9">Dan 7.9</ref>,<ref loc="DAN 7:22">22</ref>,<ref loc="DAN 7:27">27</ref>.</char>
    </note> Ndakakobona zwigalo zobumambo, bakabeligele pazwili ndiyibabo bakapiwa masimba etonga. Kakale ndakabona meya dzayibabo bakabathubugwa miholo nentha yepa busupi nekwaYesu kose nentha yedama leNdzimu, ibabo basakanamata tjibanda kene tjibumbwa tjatjo, kakale basakalongwa lutjayo gwatjo pawhuma dzabo kene pamaboko abo. Bakatjila kakale, bakatonga panhu pan'ompela naKhirisitu kwemakole alitjiwulu. <verse eid="REV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5" />(Bamwe bafi bose abazwotjila kuswikila kwapela makole ali tjiwulu.) Whoku ndiko muka kwebafi kwekutanga. <verse eid="REV 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6" />Wakakombolegwa kakale wakayengemala iwhoya unowhohanganyila mukumuka kwebafi kwekutanga! Lufu gwebubili agutjina masimba pehhugwi kwewakajalo, koga ibo banowhoba baphirisiti beNdzimu nebaKhirisitu, kakale banowhotonga naye kwemakole alitjiwulu.<verse eid="REV 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kundiwa KwaSatane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7" />Hapa kwapela makole elitjiwulu Satane unowhosunungugwa mujele lile <verse eid="REV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 38:2">Eze 38.2</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 38:9">9</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 38:15">15</ref>.</char></note> unowhobhuda akayenda enotjebela njudzi kuntha dzilina dzehango, kubva kuti Gogu naMagogu, ebakubunganya kuti bamuse ngwa; bunji gwabo gwakagunga nsetje wegungwa. <verse eid="REV 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 1:10-12">2 Bom 1.10-12</ref>.</char></note> Bakahhala hango yose, bakakombeledza bugalo gwebayengemali, iwo nzi-nkulu unodikala, koga kwakajita moto ubva kudzimu ukapisa bose. <verse eid="REV 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10" />Mvanganyi iye waka abatjebela wakaposegwa mubibi lemoto nesalifa, paka pena tjibanda nenlebesambeli wemanyepwa; ibo banowhodziyidziwa tjoselele siku nesikati.<verse eid="REV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tongwa Kwebupelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11" />Ndakakobona tjigalo tjebumambo tjitjena tjikulukulu, na iwhoyo waka eligele patjili, nekudzimu nehango kwakatihha pawunli, kukasitjhapamhe kukabon'wa. <verse eid="REV 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12" />Ndakabona bafi, bakulu nebatukununu, balimile mbeli kwetjigalo tjebumambo, whalo dzakahhugwa. Kwakahhugwa gumwe lukwalo, gunoba lukwalo gobutjilo. Ndizo bafi bakatongwa kubva muzwinhu zwaka zwakakwagwa muwhalo, kuyendidzana nemihingo yabo. <verse eid="REV 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13" />Ipapo gungwa lakapfa bose bakabafila mulili, Lufu neHhedesi kwakadusa bo bose baka bali mukuli, bakatongewa bose kuyendidzana nezwabakabathama. <verse eid="REV 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14" />Lufu neHhedesi kwakaposegwa mubibi lemoto. Bibi lemoto ndigo lufu gwebubili. <verse eid="REV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15" />Hapa kuna wakawanika esakakwagwa mulukwalo gobutjilo, iwhoyo wakaposegwa mubibi lemoto.<verse eid="REV 20:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21" />
  <para style="s">Kudzimu Kutshwa NeHango Tshwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 66:22">Isa 66.22</ref>.</char>
    </note> Ndakakobona kudzimu kutshwa nehango tshwa, ngobe kudzimu kwekutanga nehango yekutanga kwaka kwapinda, negungwa lisitjipo. <verse eid="REV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 3:12">Zumb 3.12</ref>. </char></note> Ndakabona nzi-nkulu wakayengemala, Jerusalema tshwa, lijita libva kudzimu kuNdzimu, lakabaakanyiwa, senlongo wakambalila nohangana nenlume uwe. <verse eid="REV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 37:27">Eze 37.27</ref>.</char></note> Ndakawha whi gulugulu libhuda kudzimu liti, “Linga, bugalo gweNdzimu gwatjiba kubanhu, iye unowhogala pakati kwabo nayibo banowhoba banhu babe, kakale Ndzimu tjekukwe unowhoba nabo, akaba Ndzimu wabo. <verse eid="REV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 25:8">Isa 25.8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 35:10">35.10</ref>.</char></note> Unowhobuhika mihodzi yose kumeho abo, kakale lufu nelila kene kuwa, kene gwadziwa akutjowhobayapo, ngobe zwinhu zwikulukugwi zwapinda.”<verse eid="REV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 43:19">Isa 43.19</ref>.</char>
    </note> Iwhoyo waka eligele patjigalo tjebumambo wakati, “Ndeyeta kuti zwinhu zose zwibe zwitshwa.” Kakale wakati, “Kwala ikoku, ngobe matama iyawa alebeswa kakale anogalikamoyo.” <verse eid="REV 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:1">Isa 55.1</ref>.</char></note> Kakale wakati kundili, “Kwatjiyetika! Ndimi Alifa naOmega, kutangisa nekupedzisila. Unanyota ndowhowumpa vula inobva mudonsa levula yebutjilo kusina nlipo. <verse eid="REV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 89:27-28">Njimb 89.27-28</ref>.</char></note> Iye unokunda, unowhogala nhaka yayikoku kose, imi ndowhoba Ndzimu uwe iye unowhoba nkololo wangu. <verse eid="REV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 30:33">Isa 30.33</ref>.</char></note> Koga magwala, nebasina bugalimoyo, nebanahambgwa, nebabulayi, nebanopinga, nebanokandila malipa, banonamata zwidzimwana, nebanyepi bose, bugalo gwabo gumubibi lemoto nesalifa, gunoba igo lufu gwebubili.”<verse eid="REV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalema Tshwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9" />Kwakakohha kundili umwe webatumwa bekudzimu balikutondeka ibabo baka bakasenga ndigwana dzilikutondeka dzakadzilihhele mboli dzilikutondeka dzekupedzisila, wakalebeleka nami eti, “Ihha ngeno ndikulakidze Nlongo, iye mfumakadzi weMwizana.” <verse eid="REV 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10" />Wakandisenga ndilimuMeya tikayenda kudombo gulugulu lefulefu wakandilakidza nzi-nkulu wakayengemala, ilo Jerusalema, lijita libhuda kudzimu libva kuNdzimu. <verse eid="REV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11" />Waka unagudzo leNdzimu, penyelela kwawo kwaka kunga kwebgwe linatjilemela, sebgwe linoyi jasipa, kubelengela segilazi. <verse eid="REV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 48:30-35">Eze 48.30-35</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 28:21">Ful 28.21</ref>.</char></note> Waka unaguma gulugulu lefulefu lina mikoba ili gumi nemibili, pamikoba kwaka kuna batumwa bekudzimu bali gumi nebabili, pamikoba kwaka kwakakwagwa mazina enjudzi dziligumi nembili dzebakololo ba Isirayeli. <verse eid="REV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13" />Kuntha yekubhehhuba kwaka kuna mikoba mitatu, kuntha yekubunandzwa kuna mikoba mitatu, kuntha yekuburwa kuna mikoba mitatu, kuntha yekumahwahhuba kuna mikoba mitatu. <verse eid="REV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14" />Guma lenzi-nkulu laka lina mbviwa dzili gumi nembili, pehhugwi kwadzo kwaka kwakakwagwa mazina ali gumi nemabili ebapositoli beMwizana. <verse eid="REV 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:5">Eze 40.5</ref>.</char></note> Ntunwa wekudzimu waka elebeleka nami waka analukombo gwezeezi gweyelesa nzi-nkulu nemikoba yawo nemakuma awo. <verse eid="REV 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16" />Ntha dzose dzilina dzenzi-nkulu dzaka dzakalizana, bulefu gulizana nebupabi; wakayela nelukombo gugwe bulefu gukaba makhilomitha angaba zwiwulu zwibili zwinamakulu mabili; bulefu nebupabi neyenda pehhugwi kwaka kwakalizana. <verse eid="REV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17" />Ntumwa wekudzimu wakayela yenda pehhugwi kweguma ehingisa zila yeyela kwenhu, akawana kungalizana nemamitha ali makumi ali kutanhatu anamahanu. <verse eid="REV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18" />Guma lakabe lakabakiwa nemabgwe e jasipa, nzi-nkulu wakabe wakabakiwa nezeezi lakwako, lipenyelela segilazi linobelengela. <verse eid="REV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19" />Mbviwa dzeguma pasi kwadzo dzaka dzakanakisiwa nemabgwe anatjilemela; bgwe lokutanga laka lilijasipa, lebubili lili safaya, lebutatu lili ageti, lebuna lili emaralidi, <verse eid="REV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20" />Lebuhanu lili onikisi, lebutanhatu lili khanelini, lekutondeka lili khirisolithe, lebuhhakadzi lili bheyili, lebuhhanalume lili thopazi, legumi lili khiriyisopasasi, legumi linakun'ompela lili jasiti, legumi linakubili lili ametisiti. <verse eid="REV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21" />Mikoba iligumi nemibili yaka ili yemabgwe endalama dzili gumi nembili, umwe newumwe nkoba wakayetiwa neludzi gun'ompela gwebgwe lendalama, mwahha wenzi-nkulu waka uli wezeezi lakwako segilazi linobelengela.<verse eid="REV 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22" />Andizobona thempeli munzi-nkulu iwhoyo, ngobe thempeli yawo ndiHe Ndzimu Wemasimba ose neMwizana. <verse eid="REV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 24:23">Isa 24.23</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 60:1">60.1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 60:19">19</ref>.</char></note> Akutohakika kuti kube netjedza tjehhuba netjemwedzi munzi-nkulu, ngobe gudzo leNdzimu itjedza tjawo, tjivoneko tjawo iMwizana. <verse eid="REV 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24" />Njudzi dzowhotjila ngetjedza tjawo; bomambo behango banowhohha negudzo labo kuwunli, <verse eid="REV 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25" />nemikoba yenzi-nkulu iwhoyu ayitowhohhaligwa masikati, ngobe kowhoba kusina busiku ipapo. <verse eid="REV 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26" />Kudziwa nelemekedzewa kwehango kowhohhisiwa kunzi-nkulu iwhoyu. <verse eid="REV 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27" />Koga akuna tjinahambgwa tjinowhongina munzi-nkulu iwhoyu, kene iye unothama zwinohemesa kene unoleba manyepwa. Koga kowhongina ibabo bakakwagwa mulukwalo gwebutjilo gweMwizana.<verse eid="REV 21:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1" />Ntumwa wekudzimu wakakondilakidza gwizi gwevula yebutjilo, ilimbuyanana yakayengemala segilazi linobelengela, iwunga ibva mutjigalo tjobumambo tjeNdzimu netjeMwizana <verse eid="REV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2" />gwakaguwunga napakati kwemwahha wenzi-nkulu. Seli yegwizi kwakakuna nti webutjilo unozwala mitjelo kagumi nekubili pagole, unozwala mitjelo mwedzi nemwedzi, mahhani enti iwhoyo aka eli elapa zwitjaba. <verse eid="REV 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3" />Kowhoba kusitjina tjakalongwa bhiso munzi-nkulu iwhoyo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:3">Tjigalo tjebumambo tjeNdzimu netjeMwizana zowhobe munzi-nkulu, balanda babe banowhunamata. <verse eid="REV 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4" />Banowhobona buso gugwe, zina lile lowhoba lakakwagwa pawhuma dzabo. <verse eid="REV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5" />Busiku gowhoba gusitjipo, banowhoba basingatjahake tjedza tjetjivoneko kene tjedza tjehhuba, ngobe He Ndzimu unowhoba tjedza tjabo, banowhotonga nekusingapele.<verse eid="REV 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hha kwaYesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6" />Ntumwa wekudzimu wakakoti kundili, “Matama iyawa anogalikabgwe kakale alebeswa. He, iye Ndzimu wemeya dzebalebesambeli, wakatuma ntumwa uwe kuti alakidze balanda babe zwinhu zwinowhoyetika nelubakanyana gunotobela.”<verse eid="REV 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7" />Yesu wakati, “Linga, ndohha nekulibilidza. Wakakombolegwa iwhoyo unotjengeta matama ebulebesambeli gwelukwalo igogu.”<verse eid="REV 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8" />Imi Johane ndimi ndakawha kakale ndikabona zwinhu izwezwi. Ndakati ndatjizwiwha kakale ndazwibona, ndakapfigama pamakumbo entumwa wekudzimu wakandilakidza zwinhu zwezwi kuti ndiwunamate. <verse eid="REV 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9" />Koga wakati kundili, “Usithame ujalo, ngobe imi ndinlanda bo kan'ompela nawe nemakamu awo ibo balebesambeli, nayibabo banotjengeta matama amulukwalo igogu. Iwe namata Ndzimu.” <verse eid="REV 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10" />Kakale wakati kundili, “Usibuwile Usibuwe matama ebulebesambeli gwelukwalo igogu, ngobe lubaka gwabepedlo. <verse eid="REV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11" />Umbi ngaagale eyeta bubi; unahambgwa ngaagale anahambgwa; wakalulama ngaagale eyeta tjakalulama, wakayengemala ngaagale akayengemala.”<verse eid="REV 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12" />“Linga, ndohha nekulibilidza, mbhayilo wangu ndowhoba ndinawo, kuti ndipe umwe newumwe nhu kunoyendidzana nehinga kukwe. <verse eid="REV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13" />Ndimi Alifa naOmega, kutangisa nekupedzisila, mabambo nebupelo.”<verse eid="REV 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14" />Bakakombolegwa banosuka zwiyambalo zwabo, kuyetila kuti babe bakafanila hha kunti webutjilo nekuti bangine munzi-kulu nemikoba. <verse eid="REV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15" />Koga kuhhe kwenzi-nkulu, kuna mbgwa, nebanokandila malipa, nebanopinga, nebabulayi, nebanonamata zwidzimwana, newose unoda leba manyepwa kakale unogala enyepa.<verse eid="REV 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16" />“Imi Yesu ndimi ndakatuma ntumwa wangu kumuli nebusupi igogu kumakubungano ebagalimoyo, Ndimi ndzi waDavida nembewu iye, ndimi nyenyedzi masasi.”<verse eid="REV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17" />Meya neNlongo banoti “Ihha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:17">Unowha ngaati “Ihha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:17">Unanyota ngaahhe, yani nayani unoda ngaatole vula yebutjilo kusina nlipo.<verse eid="REV 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fidza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18" />Imi ndotjenjedza wose unowha matama ebulebesambeli gwelukwalo igogu, kukaba nenhu unopamidzila pehhugwi kwawo, Ndzimu unowhowumpamidzilila mboli dzakakwagwa mulukwalo igogu. <verse eid="REV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19" />Kukaba nenhu unotapudza matama elukwalo igogu gwebulebesambeli, Ndzimu unowhotapudza gobe lile panti webutjilo, nemunzi-nkulu wakayengemala, kunotjenesewa mulukwalo igogu.<verse eid="REV 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20" />Iwhoyo unopa busupi gwezwinhu izwezwi, unoti “Lebeswa, ndohha nekulibilidza.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:20">Akujalo. Ihhani, He Yesu!<verse eid="REV 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21" />Ngoni dzaHe Yesu ngadzibe nenhu wose.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">zimwe whalo whulukugwi dzoti “Ngoni dzaHe wedu Yesu ngadzibe nebayengemali bose.</char></note><verse eid="REV 22:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22" />
